<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">Dowe Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mbuli Idamane yandikigwe na Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mbuli Idamane yandikigwe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohana</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOZI</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbuli Idamane iyandikigwe na Yohana ni imwe ya vitabu vinne mdilagano dya haluse vikusimulila ivo akalile akukala Yesu Kilisito. Kila kimwe ya vitabu ivo kikutangwa “Injili.” Mbuli iyo ikumaanisha “Mbuli Idamane.” Vitabu vino vyandikigwa na Matayo, Maliko, Luka na Yohana ivo ifosile kudanganika kwa Yesu. Mbuli Idamane yandikigwe na Yohana ikudahika yandikigwa na Yohana mwaka wa tisini kulawa kwelekwa Yesu Kilisito. Mbali chitabu hakikulonga kuwa Yohana nio akiandikile, vila iyandikigwe ikulingana na balua za Yohana 1 na Yohana 2 na Yohana 3. Wandishi wamwenga wa umwaka wakumsimulila Yohana kuwa kakala akukala mdibululu dya Efeso mui chipindi icho, ivo ikudahikana kandika chitabu chino akawa mdibululu dya Efeso.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohana akulonga bila ya kufisa kuwa kandika chitabu chino ili kuwataza want'hu wadahe kumtogola Yesu Kilisito, Mwana wa Mulungu amgima. Yohana 20:31. Kwa kutogola ivo, chikupata ugima kwa ivo akaandika Chitabu chino kiandikwa kwa ajili ya Wayahudi na wala sio Wayahudi. Mbuli Idamane ya Yohana hailingane na Mbuli Zidamane zila nt'hatu zimwenga. Yohana kaika mtint'hiso wake mu ula uzonza autendile Yesu, na handikile mbuli nyingi za milinganyo ailavile Yesu. Mbuli nk'hulu gesa vila ya Yesu kubatizigwa na kugezigwa kwake kuchiwala haziandikigwe mchitabu chino.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yeli umo</para>
  <para style="io">Yohana akuiandusa Mbuli Idamane mui sula ya 1:1-18,</para>
  <para style="io">Kamala akwandika kuusu miuzonza imwenga aitendile Yesu, mui sula ya 1:19-12:50,</para>
  <para style="io">Kamala akusimulila mbuli nyingi zilawile muna ugima wa Yesu, mbuli zigalile kudanganika kwake na kubwela muugima, mui sula ya 13:1-20 na 31.</para>
  <para style="io">Yohana akukomelezela injili yake mui sula ya 21 kwa kusimulila Yesu ivo awalawile want'hu baada ya kubwela muugima na kamala akusimulila kimtendile Yohana aandike chitabu chino.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s">Mbuli katendeka mtufi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Aho haumwanduso ivo ikalile vint'hu vose havinalumbwa kukala na Mbuli, na iyo Mbuli kalala hamwenga na Mulungu, na iyo Mbuli kalala Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Nae Mbuli kakala hamwenga na Mulungu tangu kumwanduso. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Vint'hu vose vilumbigwa kufosela iyo Mbuli, na habule kint'hu chochote chilumbigwe bila yeye. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Mgati mmwake mkala ugima, na ugima uo ni lumuli kwa want'hu. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Na lumuli uo ukumulika mdiziza na ziza hadidahile kuuhuma lumuli.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Kukala na Mnt'hu imwe atumigwe na Mulungu, zina dyake Yohana. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Yohana keza kuwalongela want'hu mbuli ya iyo lumuli. Keza ili kwa kuwalongela kwake want'hu wose watogole. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Yohana hakalile uo lumuli, mbali keza kuwalongela want'hu mbuli ya uo lumuli. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Uo ndo lumuli wa kweli, wiza muiisi kuwamulikila want'hu wose. <verse eid="JHN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Iyo Mbuli kakala mui isi, kufosela iyo Mbuli vint'hu vose vilumbigwa, mbali want'hu hawammanyile. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Keza kwa want'hu wake, mbali want'hu wake hawamuhokele. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Mbali wala wamuhokele na kumtogola akawenk'ha udahi wa kutendeka kuwa wana wa Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Wawa wana wa Mulungu sio kwa nzila ya kwelekigwa na welesi egu kwa vila want'hu wakubweda kuwa na wana, na hawaelekigwe kwa vila mnt'hu kalonda kuwa na mwana mbali ni Mulungu mwenyewe kawatenda wawe wanake.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Mbuli katendeka mtufi na akakala hamwenga na cheye, na cheye chikauona utunyo wake, na utunyo wake gesa wa Mwana dumwe akulawa kwa Tata kamema wende wa Mulungu na kweli.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Yohana akawalongela want'hu mbuli za mnt'hu iyo, kakala akulonga kwa izi kulu, “Ino ndo ila niwalongeleni, ‘Naeze kulongozi kumwangu mnt'hu mkulu kuhuma nie, kwa vila kakala uko tangu nie sihali.’”<verse eid="JHN 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Kulawana na wingi wa ubwedo wake, cheye chose chihokela wende wa Mulungu kaidi na kaidi. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Kwa vila Malagilizo yeza kufosela Musa, mbali wende wa Mulungu na ukweli viza kufosela Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Habule Mnt'hu yoyote awahile kumuona Mulungu, mbali Mwana adumwe ila ahaguhi na Tata, iyo ndo amtendile Tata amanyike.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nt'hume ya Yohana Mbatizi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matayo 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maliko 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Ino ndo nt'hume ailongile Yohana chipindi vilongozi wa Kiyahudi kula Yelusalemu ivo wawalagilizile walava nt'hambiko na Walawi kwita kwa Yohana wakamuuze, “Weye niani?”<verse eid="JHN 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Yohana halemile mbali akawalongela, “Niye sio Kilisito mgombozi.” <verse eid="JHN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Wakamuuza, “Ivo elo weye ni niani? Egu weye ni Eliya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Yohana akalonga aka nie sio?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Wakamuuza egu weye ni ila Mlotezi alongigwe naeze?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Akalonga “Aka nie siyo.” <verse eid="JHN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Kamala wakamuuza, “Weye niani? Chilongele Ili chipate cha kwita kuwalongela wala wachitumile. Elo chilongele weye niani?” <verse eid="JHN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Yohana akawalongela kuwa nie ndo ila muhulike mbuli zake kulawa kwa Isaya mulotezi wa Mulungu, alongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:23">“Sauti ya mnt'hu ikutanga mchiwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:23">Igololeni nzila ya kufosela Mndewa.”<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Want'hu ao wakala watumigwa na Mafalisayo, <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />wakamuuza Yohana, “Ikawa weye sio kilisito, wala sio Eliya na wala sio mulotezi wa Mulungu ila alongigwe akwiza hangi ukubatiza?” <verse eid="JHN 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Yohana akawalongela, “Niye hubatiza kwa mazi, mbali hagati yenu hana mnt'hu mweye hamummanyile. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Iyo naeze halongozi hangu, mbali nie sikuagizwa hata kufungula ngozi ya vilatu vake.”<verse eid="JHN 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Mbuli zino zose zilawila uko Besania, mwambo ya mto Yolidani, hant'hu Yohana akalile akubatiza.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Mwanangoto wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Siku ya kaidi, Yohana akamuona Yesu akumwizila halongozi hake na Yohana akalonga, “Ino ndo mwanangoto wa Mulungu akuhalava zambi za want'hu wose. <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Ino ndo ila niwalongeleni halongozi hangu naeze mnt'hu mkulu kuhuma nie, kwa vila yeye kakala auko tangu nie sinaeza! <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Nie mwenyewe aho haumwanduso simmanyile, mbali niza kubatiza want'hu kwa mazi, ili want'hu wa Izilaeli wadahe kummanya.” <verse eid="JHN 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Kamala Yohana akalonga vino, “Nimuona Muhe wa Mulungu ukatelemka kulawa kuulanga gesa njiwa, na akakala mchanya yake. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Nie simmanyile mbali ila anitumile nie nibatize kwa mazi kanilongela, ‘Mnt'hu ila ukulonda kumuona akutelemkelwa na Muhe wa Mulungu kulawa kuulanga gesa njiwa na kutua mchanya yake, iyo ndo akulonda kubatiza kwa Muhe wa Mulungu.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Nie niona mbuli iyo na huwalongeleni, ino ndo Mwana wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanahina wa mwanduso wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Siku ya kaidi yake, Yohana kakala uko kaidi hamwenga na wanahina wake waidi. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Ivo amuonile Yesu akufosa, akalonga, “Loleni! Ino ndo mwanangoto wa Mulungu.” <verse eid="JHN 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Wala wanahina waidi ivo wamuhulikile Yohana akulonga ayo, wakamkola Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Yesu akabiduka kunyuma, akawaona wala wanahina wakumkola akawauza, “Mkulonda mbwani?” Nao wakamuuza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">“Mfunza ukukala kwani?” Labi ikumanisha mfunza. <verse eid="JHN 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Yesu akawalongela, “Inzoni na mweye namuhaone.” Ivo wakaita wakahaona hant'hu aho. Kwa vila ikala saa kumi ya dihungile ivo awakabili, wakagona aho siku iyo. <verse eid="JHN 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Andelea ndugu yake Simoni Petulo, kakala imwe wa wala waidi wamuhulikile Yohana akulonga ivo, na akamkola Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Andelea ivo alekane na Yesu, kint'hu cha mwanduso atendile Andelea ni kumulonda Saimoni ndugu yake na akamulongela, “Chimuona Masihi yani asaguligwe na Mulungu.” <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Kamala Andelea akamgala Saimoni kwa Yesu. Yesu ivo amulolile Simoni, akalonga, “Weye ni Simoni mwana wa Yohana. Nautangigwe Kefa” Kwa kigiliki ni Petulo, yani, “Talawe.”<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuwatanga Filipu na Nasanaeli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Siku ya kaidi yake, Yesu akalamula kwita kudibululu dya Galilaya, na uko akamfika mnt'hu imwe zina dyake Filipu, akamulongela, “Nikole” <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Iyo Filipu na ndugu yake Petulo wakala wakaya wa bululu dya Betisaida. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Filipu akamfika Nasanaeli na akamulongela, “Chimfika Yesu wa Nazaleti mwana wa Josefu ila Musa kandika mbuli zake mvitabu va Malagilizo na ila walotezi wandikile mbuli zake.” <verse eid="JHN 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Nasanaeli akamuuza Filipu, “Vino, ikudahika kint'hu kidamane kulawa Nazaleti?” Filipu akamulongela, “Inzo ulole!” <verse eid="JHN 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Yesu ivo amuonile Nasanaeli akumwizila, akalonga, “Ino ni msingili wa Izilaeli kweli kweli, na abule uhuni mgati mmwake!” <verse eid="JHN 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Nayo Nasanieli akamuuza Yesu, “Kudahaze kunimanya?” Yesu akamulongela, “Nikuona ivoukalile hasi ya mti wa mkuyu tangu Filipu hanakutanga.”<verse eid="JHN 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Nasanaeli akamulongela, “Mfunza, weye ni Mwana wa Mulungu. Weye ndo Mwene wa Izilaeli!”<verse eid="JHN 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yesu akamulongela Nasanaeli, “Kwa vila kutogola vila nikulongele nikuona tangu unk'hali hasi ya mti wa mkuyu. Nauone mbuli nk'hulu kuhuma izo.” <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Yesu akawalongela, “Huwalongela ukweli, mweye namuone ulanga ukagubuka na wasank'hani wa kuulanga kwa Mulungu wakukwela mchanya na kutelemka hasi kwa ajili ya Mwana wa Mnt'hu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s">Zengele ditendeke kudibululu da Kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Siku ya katatu kukala na zengele kudibululu da Kana ya Galilaya, na Mami yake Yesu kakala uko, <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Yesu hamwenga na wanahina wake, na ao watangigwa kudizengele. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Divai ivo imalile, Mami yake Yesu akamulongela, “Divai imala.” <verse eid="JHN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Yesu akamulongela mami yake, “Mama usekunilongela da kutenda, saa ya kutenda sank'hano yangu ink'hali hainafika.” <verse eid="JHN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Mami yake Yesu akawalongela wasank'hani, “Chochote akulonda kuwalongeleni tendeni.” <verse eid="JHN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Aho hakala na mabiga sita ya kuikila mazi yatengenezigwe na maibwe, kwa ajili ya Wayahudi ivo wazowele kuinawila, kila biga dimwe dikusola madebe matano egu sita. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Yesu akawalongela wala wasank'hani, “Yamemezeni mazi mabiga yano.” Nao wakamemeza yala mabiga hadi kuchanya. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Kamala akawalongela, “Elo tekeni mumgalile mkulu wa kutala ndia.” Nao wakateka wakamgalila. <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Ila mkulu wa kutala ndia ivo akayalanza yala mazi akafika yabiduka yawa divai. Hamanyile divai iyo uko ilawile, mbali wala wasank'hani watekile yala mazi wakala wamanya uko yalawile. Ila mkulu akamtanga ila mzengele kunk'handa, <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />akamulongela “Want'hu wose, tenk'hu wakulava divai idamane, kamala watafi wakang'wa wakakolela wakugala divai ihile, mbali weye kugala divai idamane hadi haluse!” <verse eid="JHN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Kino ndo kilagiso cha mwanduso cha Yesu akitendile uko kudibululu dya Kana ya Galilaya. Yesu kaulagisa utunyo wake, na wanahina wake wakamtogola. <verse eid="JHN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Kamala ivo akomeleze ayo yose, Yesu hamwenga na Mamiake na ndugu zake na Wanahina wake, wakatelemka hadi Kapelinaumu, na wakakala uko kwa siku ndodo.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akwita kui Kaya ya Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:12">Matayo 21:12</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 21:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Maliko 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45">Luka 19:45</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 19:46">46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Ivo ifikile haguhi na sikunk'hulu ya Pasaka ya Wayahudi, Yesu akakwela kwita Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Uko kui Kaya ya Mulungu akawafika Want'hu wakugula ng'ombe na ngoto na njiwa na wamwenga wakala mvisumbi wakuvunja hela. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Akabota mulugwa kwa ngozi kamala akawainga wose walawe hai Kaya ya Mulungu, hamwenga na ngoto na ng'ombe. Vila vila akazipwimwilusa hela zawe na kuzibidula meza za wala wakubadilisha hela. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Akawalongela wala wakalile wakugula njiwa, “Wahalaveni njiwa wenu hano, msekuitenda Kaya ya Tati yangu iwe gulilo.” <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Wanahina wake wakakumbukila vila maandiko ya Mulungu yalongile kuwa, “Mulungu, kuibweda kwangu kaya yako nakunikome.” <verse eid="JHN 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Aho ndo Wayahudi wamwenga wakamuuza Yesu, “Ukudaha kutenda kilagiso kili cha kukangawaza chikulonda kuchilagisa unao ukulu wa kutenda yano yose?” <verse eid="JHN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Yesu akawalongela, “Ibomoleni ino Kaya ya Mulungu, na nie naniizenge kaidi kwa siku nt'hatu.” <verse eid="JHN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Wala Wayahudi wakamuuza, “Kaya ino izengigwa kwa myaka alubaini na sita, weye naudaheze kuizenga kwa siku nt'hatu?” <verse eid="JHN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Mbali Kaya ya Mulungu akalile akuilonga Yesu ikala mtufi wake. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Yesu ivo abwelezigwe muugima, wanahina wake wakakumbukila yala walongelwe, wakayatogola Maandiko ya Mulungu na yala wakalile wakulongeligwa na Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuimanya myoyo ya want'hu wose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Yesu ivo akalile Yelusalemu kui sikunk'hulu ya Pasaka, Want'hu wengi wamtogola ivo waonile vilagiso ivo akalile akuvitenda. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Mbali Yesu kakala haitogole utogozi wawe kumwake kwa vila kakala akuwamanya ivo weli mumoyo. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Halondile kulongelwa kint'hu chochote kuhusu want'hu, kwa vila kakala akuvimanya vose vila vili mmioyo yawe.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na Nikodemo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Hakala na Kilongozi imwe mchitala cha Wayahudi zina dyake Nikodemo, akalile imwe wa Mafalisayo. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Mnt'hu iyo akamwitila Yesu ichilo na akamulongela, “Mfunza, chikumanya kuwa weye ni Mfunza utumigwe na Mulungu, kwa vila habule mnt'hu akudaha kutenda vilagiso, ikawa Mulungu hahamwenga nae.”<verse eid="JHN 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Yesu akamulongela, “Hukulongela kweli, habule mnt'hu akudaha kuuona Umwene wa Mulungu ikawa hana elekwa lwa kaidi.”<verse eid="JHN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nikodemo akamuuza, “Ikudahikaze mnt'hu mulala kwelekigwa lwa kaidi? Akudahaze kuingila mumunda wa mami yake na kwelekigwa kaidi?”<verse eid="JHN 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Yesu akamulongela, “Hukulongela kweli habule Mnt'hu yoyote akudaha kuingila mu Umwene wa Mulungu ikawa haelekigwe kwa Mazi na kwa Muhe wa Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Mnt'hu akuelekigwa kimtufi kwa tatiyake na mamiyake, mbali akuelekigwa Kimuhe kwa Muhe wa Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Ivo elo usekukangawala nikakulongela ukulondigwa kwelekigwa lwa kaidi. <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Mp'heho ikuvuma na ikwita hohote aho ikulonda. Mvumo wake ukuhulikika mbali haukumanyika uko ukulawa wala uko ukwita. Vino nivo ili kwa kila mnt'hu aelekigwe kwa Muhe wa Mulungu.” <verse eid="JHN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Nikodemo akamuuza, “Mbuli zino zikudahikaze?” <verse eid="JHN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Yesu akamulongela “Weye ni mfunza mui isi ya Izilaeli, mbali naweye unk'hali hunazikombaganya mbuli zino? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Hukulongela kweli, cheye chikuwalongela mbuli chizimanyile na chikuwalongela mbuli chizionile, mbali mweye mkuilema nt'hume yetu. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Ikawa niwalongela mbuli za mui isi na mweye hamnitogolele, namnitogoleleze nikawalongela mbuli za kuulanga? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Habule mnt'hu yoyote aitile kuulanga kwa Mulungu ukaleka Mwana wa Mnt'hu, atelemkile hasi kulawa kuulanga.”<verse eid="JHN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Gesa vila Musa ivo amtumbikile nyoka mumti kula kuchiwala, na Mwana wa Mnt'hu na atumbikigwe ivoivo. <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />Ili kila Mnt'hu akulonda kumtogola awe na ugima wa siku zose ubule nk'homelezo. <verse eid="JHN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Kwa vila Mulungu kawabweda want'hu wa isi zose hadi akamulava Mwanake adumwenga, ili kila mnt'hu akumtogola asekwaga mbali awe na ugima wa siku zose. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Kwa vila Mulungu hamtumile Mwanake mui isi kwiza kuwalamula want'hu kwa uhasanyi wao mbali keza kuwahonya.<verse eid="JHN 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Yoyote akumtogola Mwana seke alamulwe, mbali wala hawamtogolile ao walamulwa kale, kwa vila hawamtogole Mwana adumwenga wa Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Dino ndo lamulo, nao lumuli wiza kwa want'hu wa mui isi, mbali want'hu wakabweda ziza kuhuma lumuli, kwa vila nt'hendwa zawe ziha. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Kwa vila wose wakutenda ubananzi hawakubweda lumuli na hawakwiza kuna ulumuli kwa vila hawakulonda mbuli zawe zihile zimanyikane. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Mbali ila akutenda mbuli akuzilonda Mulugu, akwiza kuna ulumuli ili nt'hendwa zake zioneke bila kufisika kuwa zitendeka kwa kumuhulika Mulungu.<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yohana Mbatizi akusimulila mbuli za Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Ivo yamalile ayo, Yesu na Wanahina wake wakaita mui isi ya Yudea, nae akakala uko kwa chipindi chidodo na kuwabatiza want'hu. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Yohana nayo kakala akubatiza uko kuki bululu cha Ainoni, haguhi na bululu dya Salemu, kwa vila uko kukala na mazi mengi, Want'hu wakala wakumwitila uko na kubatizwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Yano yalawila, Yohana ivo akalile ank'hali hanafungigwa.<verse eid="JHN 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Upinzani ukalawila hagati ya Wanahina wa Yohana na Muyahudi imwe kwa mbuli ya kuisunt'ha ili kuisasali ili kumfugamalila Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Kamala wanahina ao wakamwitila Yohana wakamulongela “Mfunza ila mnt'hu akalile hamwenga na weye kula mwambo ya mto wa Yolidani, ila uchisimulile mbuli zake, elo akubatiza na kila mnt'hu akumwitila.” <verse eid="JHN 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Yohana akawalongela, “Habule Mnt'hu akudaha kuwa na kint'hu chochote ikawa haink'higwe na Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Mweye wenyewe muhulika kila nikilongile kuwa nie sio Kilisito asaguligwe na Mulungu, mbali nitumigwa ili nimulongolele. <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Msola, ndo akumsola msoligwa. Mbali mbuyake msola mke ila akutimalala haguhi nae na kumtegeleza, akubweda nk'hani kuhulika ivo akulonga. Kwa sababu ya mbuli ino ubwedo wangu ulawila. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Kilisito msaguligwa na Mulungu akulondigwa kuwa mkulu nk'hani, mbali nie hulondigwa kuhunguka kuwa mdodo.”<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli za ila akwiza kulawa kuulanga kwa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />Ila akwiza kulawa kuulanga kwa Mulungu ni mkulu kuhuma vose. Ila akulawa mui isi ni wa mui isi, na akulonga mbuli za mui isi. Mbali ila akwiza kulawa kuulanga kwa Mulungu ni mkulu kuhuma vose. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Yeye akuwalongela want'hu yala ayaonile na kuyahulika kulawa kuulanga, mbali habule mnt'hu akuzitogola mbuli zake azilongile. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Mnt'hu yoyote akutogola mbuli zake, iyo naalagise kuwa ayo akuyalonga Mulungu ni wa kweli. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Ila atumigwe na Mulungu akulonga mbuli za Mulungu, kwa vila Mulungu kammemezela Muhe wake bila kumpimila. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Tata akumbweda Mwanake na kamwink'ha vint'hu vose viwe hasi ya ukulu wake. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Yoyote akumtogola Mwana ana ugima wa siku zose bila nk'homelezo. Mbali mnt'hu yoyote hakumtegeleza Mwana iyo sekeawe na ugima wa siku zose, mbali naasigale muna amaya ya Mulungu.<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na mwanamke Msamalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Mafalisayo wahulika kuwa Yesu akuwatenda want'hu wengi kuwa wanahina wake na kuwabatiza kuhuma Yohana. <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />Mbali Yesu hakalile akubatiza, mbali wakalile wakubatiza ni wanahina wake. <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Yesu ivo ahulikile mbuli izo, akahalawa Yudea akabwela kui isi ya Galilaya.<verse eid="JHN 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Ivo nt'hambo iyo imtenda afosele Samalia. <verse eid="JHN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Akafika hant'hu hakutangwa Sikali kuna idibululu dya Samalia, haguhi na ula mgunda wa Josefu aink'higwe na tati yake akutangwa Yakobo. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Hant'hu aho hakala na chisima cha Yakobo, ivo kwa vila Yesu kakala kasoka mui nt'hambo, akakala haguhi na icho chisima. Iyo ikala gesa saa sita ya msanya.<verse eid="JHN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Mwanamke imwe wa isi ya Samalia akeza aho kuteka mazi, Yesu ivo amuonile akamulongela, “Hulomba mazi ning'we.” <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Mchipindi icho wanahina wake wakala waita kudibululu kugula ndia.<verse eid="JHN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Ila Mwanamke akamulongela, “Weye ni Muyahudi na nie ni Msamalia ivo ikudahikaze ukulonda mazi kumwangu?” Kalonga ivo kwa vila Wayahudi na Wasamalia wakala hawakupatana.<verse eid="JHN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Yesu akamulongela, “Ingi umanyile chila Mulungu akulonda kukwink'ha na ingi ummanyile ino ‘nink'he mazi ning'we.’ Weye ingi umulombile yeye na yeye ingi akwink'hile mazi ya kukwink'ha ugima wa siku zose.” <verse eid="JHN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Ila mwanamke akamulongela, “Mndewa ubule doo dya kutekela mazi na chisima chino chitali, ayo manzi ya ugima wa siku zose nauyapate kwani? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Vino, weye ni mkulu kuhuma tati yetu Yakobo iyo achink'hile sima dino, ambadyo yeye na wanake na wanyama wake wang'wa mazi ya chisima chino?” <verse eid="JHN 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Yesu akamulongela, “kila Mnt'hu akung'wa mazi yano naaone nk'hilu kaidi, <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />mbali mnt'hu yoyote akulonda kung'wa mazi yala hulonda kumwink'ha nie sekeaone nk'hilu kaidi. Mbali mazi hulonda kuwenk'ha nayawe mgati mmwake mbwebwe ikulava mazi ya ugima wa siku zose.” <verse eid="JHN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Ila mwanamke akamulongela, “Mndewa nink'he nie mazi ayo nisekuwa na nk'hilu kaidi na nisekwiza kaidi hano kuteka mazi.” <verse eid="JHN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Yesu akamulongela, “Genda kamtange Mulumako wize nayo hano.”<verse eid="JHN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Ila mwanamke akamulongela, “Nibule Mulume.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:17">Yesu akamulongela, “Ivo ulongile ubule mulume kulonga goya. <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />Kwa vila kukala kusoligwa na wanaalume watano, na iyo unayo haluse sio Mulumako, aho kulonga goya.” <verse eid="JHN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Ila Mwanamke akamulongela, “Mndewa, huona weye ni Mulotezi wa Mulungu.” <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Walala wetu kulawa Samalia wakala wakumfugamalila Mulungu hadigamba dino, mbali mweye Wayahudi mkulonga Yelusalemu ndo hant'hu hakumfugamalila Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Yesu akamulongela, “Weye mama, nitogole nie, kuna chipindi chikwiza sekemumfugamalile Tata mchanya ya gamba dino wala kula Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Mweye Wasamalia mkufugamalila kint'hu hamkimanyile, mbali cheye Wayahudi chikufugamalila kint'hu chikikumanya, kwa vila uhonyi ukulawa kwa Wayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Mbali chipindi chikwiza na haluse chifika kale, wafugamalila wa kweli wa Mulungu, nawamfugamalile Mulungu kwa kulongozwa na Muhe na kweli. Kwa vila want'hu gesa ao Tata ndo akuwalonda wamfugamalile. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Mulungu ni Muhe, na wose wakumfugamalila wakulondigwa kumfugamalila muu Muhe na kweli.”<verse eid="JHN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Ila Mwanamke akamulongela, “Humanya kuwa Masihi ila akutangigwa Kilisito naeze, na akeza naachilongele kila kint'hu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Yesu akamulongela, “Niye hulonga na weye ndo Iyo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Kamala Wanahina wake ivo wabwelile, wakakangawala nk'hani kumuona Yesu akulonga na ila mwanamke. Mbali habule mnt'hu amuuzile, “Ukulonda mbwani?” Egu, “Hangi ukulonga na ino mwanamke?”<verse eid="JHN 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Kamala ila mwanamke akadileka biga dyake, akaita kudibululu na kuwalongela want'hu, <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />“Chiteni mkamuone mnt'hu anilongele mbuli zose nizitendile. Vino ikudahika kuwa yeye ndo Kilisito?”<verse eid="JHN 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Ivo, want'hu wakalawa kudibululu na wakamwitila Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Chipindi icho wanahina wake wakala wakumulomba nk'hani Yesu kwa kulonga, “Mfunza, idya kidogo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Mbali Yesu akawalongela, “Nie ninayo ndia mweye hamuimanyile.”<verse eid="JHN 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Ivo, wala wanahaina wake wakaandusa kuiuza wenyewe, “Vino, hana mnt'hu yoyote amgalile ndia?” <verse eid="JHN 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Mbali Yesu akawalongela, “Ndia yangu ni kutenda yala akuyalonda ila anitumile na kuikomeleza sank'hano yake.”<verse eid="JHN 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Mweye mkulonga, “Ink'hali myezi minne chipindi cha kugobola kifike. Mbali nie huwalongeleni muilole migunda muone vakugobolwa vikangala na vikugozela kugobolwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Mgobozi akuhokela maliho ya ugobozi wake na kuyaduganya hamwenga kwa ajili ya ugima wa siku zose. Ili ila ahandile na mgobozi wadenk'helele hamwenga. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Ivo ula ulonzi ulongile, ‘Imwe akuhanda na imwenga akugobola.’ Ni wa kweli. <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Nie niwatuma mkagobole muna imigunda hamuihandile, walimile wamwenga, mbali mweye mkugobola kulawana na usank'hani wawe.”<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Wasamalia wengi mdibululu dila wakamtogola Yesu kwa mbuli zila azilongile ila mwanamke, vila awalongele, “Kanilongela kila kint'hu nitendile.” <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Ivo, Wasamalia wakamwitila Yesu wakamulomba akale nao, na Yesu akalala uko siku mbili.<verse eid="JHN 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Kwa mbuli zake alongile, want'hu wengi nk'hani wakamtogola. <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Wakamulongela ila Mwanamke, “Cheye hachikutogola tu kwa mbuli ulongile, cheye wenyewe chihulika na chikumanya ino ndo Muhonyi wa isi yose.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumuhonya mwana wa chilongozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Ivo zifosile siku mbili, Yesu akalawa akaita kudi bululu da Galilaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Kwa vila Yesu mwenyewe kakala kalonga, “Mulotezi hakutunywa mui isi yake.” <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Ivo afikile Galilaya, Wagalilaya wamuhokela kwa vila wakala wayaona yala atendile uko Yelusalemu muna sikunk'hulu ya Pasaka. Kwa vila na ao wakala waita kui siku nk'hulu iyo.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Kamala Yesu akabwela kaidi kuki bululu cha Kana ya uko Galilaya, hant'hu ayatendile mazi kuwa divai. Hala hakala na kilongozi imwe wa Helode akalile akuugulilwa na mwanake uko Kapelinaumu. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Kilongozi iyo ivo ahulikile Yesu keza Galilaya kulawa Yudea, akamwitila akamulomba aite akamuhonye mwanake akalile akulumwa haguhi na kudanganika. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Ivo, Yesu akamulongela, “Weye hadi uone vilagiso na uzonza ndo utogole.”<verse eid="JHN 4:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Ila chilongozi akamulongela, “Mkulu, hukulomba nk'hani chite mwanangu asekwiza kudanganika.”<verse eid="JHN 4:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Yesu akamulongela, “Genda tu, Mwanako mgima!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:50">Ila kilongozi akazitogola mbuli za Yesu na akaita. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Ivo akalile mui nzila, akafikana na wasank'hani wake na wakamulongela, “Mbwanga wako kahona!” <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Ivo akawauza, kahona saa nyingahi? Na ao wakamulongela, “Kahona tangu igolo dia saa saba ya msanya.” <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Kamala tata wa ila mwana akamanya ni saa ilaila alongeligwe na Yesu, “Mwanako kahona.” Ivo, yeye hamwenga na wose wa mui kaya yake wakamtogola Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 4:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Uwo ni ulagiso wa kaidi autendile Yesu ivo abwelile Galilaya kulawa Yudea.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akumuhonya kimbetembete Siku ya Humulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Ivo yamalile ayo Yesu akakwela kwita Yelusalemu kui siku nk'hulu ya Wayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Uko Yelusalemu haguhi na lwivi ukutangigwa Lwivi wa Ngoto, kukala na bwawa kwa kiebulania dikutangwa Betisaza, bwawa idyo dizungulukigwa na balaza tano. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Aho hakala na watamu wengi wakalile, Vipofu, vimbetembete na waholole wakugozela mazi yatibulwe. <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />Kwa vila kuna chipindi msank'hani wa kuulanga kwa Mulungu kakala akutelemka na kuyatibula yala mazi. Ivo mtamu akulonda kwandusa kuingila muna amazi yatibuligwe, akuhona utamu wake. <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Aho kukala na mnt'hu akalile mtamu nk'hani kwa myaka selasini na nane. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Yesu ivo amuonile mnt'hu iyo kagona, na kuno akamanya kuwa kakala aho kwa chipindi chitali, akamuuza, “Ukulonda kuhona?”<verse eid="JHN 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Ila mtamu akamulongela, “Weye mkulu niye nibule mnt'hu wa kunigela muna amazi chipindi yakatibuligwa, na chipindi nikalonda kuingila mnt'hu imwenga akulawila na kuingila nie nikawa sinaingila.” <verse eid="JHN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Yesu akamulongela, “Timalala, sola lili dyako ugende.” <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Aho aho mnt'hu iyo akahona, akasola lili dyake na akaandusa kugenda. Na siku ilawile mbuli iyo ikala Siku ya Humulo. <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Kulawana na iko vilongozi wa Kiyahudi wakamulongela ila mnt'hu ahonyigwe, “Dielo ni Siku ya Humulo yaani Sabato, Malagilizo yakulemesa kupapa lili dyako.”<verse eid="JHN 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Nae akawalongela, “Ila anihonyile ndo anilongele, ‘Sola lili dyako ugende.’ ” <verse eid="JHN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Wakamuuza, “Niani akulongele utende ivo?” <verse eid="JHN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Mbali mnt'hu ila ahonyigwe kakala hammanyile niani amuhonyile, kwa vila Yesu kakala kasegela na kaingila mdipelela kulu dya want'hu. <verse eid="JHN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Kamala Yesu akamfika kui Kaya ya Mulungu ila mnt'hu akalile kamuhonya akamulongela, “Tegeleza, kuhona kale, leka ubananzi, kisekwiza kukulawila kint'hu kihile kufosa kila.” <verse eid="JHN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Kamala mnt'hu ila akaita, akawalongela vilongozi wa Wayahudi kuwa ni Yesu ndo amuhonyile. <verse eid="JHN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Ivo Wayahudi wakaandusa kumgaza Yesu, kwa vila katenda mbuli izo mui Siku ya Humulo. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Yesu akawalongela, “Tati yangu akusankhana siku zose hadi haluse, na nie ivo ivo hulondigwa kusank'hana siku zose.”<verse eid="JHN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Mbuli iyo iwatenda vilongozi wa Wayahudi walonde nzila ya kumkoma Yesu. Sio kwa vila kabananga Lagilizo dya Humulo tu, mbali kwa vila Yesu kakala akulonga Mulungu ni Tati yake, ivo kaitenda yeye gesa Mulungu.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukulu wa Mwana wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Yesu akawalongela, “Huwalongeleni kweli, Mwana hakudaha kutenda chint'hu chochote akawa adumwe, akudaha kutenda kila akuona Tata akutenda. Kwa vila chint'hu chochote akuchitenda Tata Mwana nae naakitende. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Kwa vila Tata akumbweda Mwana, na akumulagisa vint'hu vose akuvitenda yeye, na naamulagise mbuli nk'hulu kuhuma zino ili na mweye mdahe kukangawala. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Gesa vila Tata ivo akuwabweleza muugima wadanganike na kuwenk'ha ugima, ivo ivo nae Mwana akuwenk'ha ugima wala akuwalonda. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Tata hakumulamula mnt'hu yoyote, mbali lamulo dyose kamulekela Mwana, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />ili want'hu wose wamtunye Mwana gesa ivo wakumtunya Tata. Ila hakumtunya Mwana hakumtunya Tata amtumile.” <verse eid="JHN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />“Huwalongeleni kweli, mnt'hu yoyote akuhulika mbuli zangu na kumtogola ila anitumile, anaugima wa siku zose na seke alamuligwe, mbali kafosa kale muukudanganika na kuingila muugima wa siku zose bila nk'homelezo. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Huwalongela kweli, chipindi chikwiza, na chifika kale, wadanganike nawaihulike sauti ya Mwana wa Mulungu, na wala wakuihulika sauti nawawe na ugima. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Gesa vila Tata ivo eli mwanduso wa ugima, ivoivo kamwink'ha Mwanake kuwa chanduso cha ugima. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Nae Mulungu kamwink'ha Mwanake ukulu wa kulamula kwa vila yeye ni mnt'hu ila atumigwe na Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Msekukangawala kwa mbuli izo, kwa vila chipindi chikwiza ambaho wala want'hu wose wammakabuli nawaihulike sauti yake. <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />Wose nawabwelezigwe muugima, wala watendile yadamane nawapate ugima wa siku zose na wala watendile ubananzi nawalamulwe.”<verse eid="JHN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wala wakulonga mbuli za Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />Nie sikudaha kutenda chint'hu chochote kwa udahi wangu mwenyewe. Nie hulamula gesa ivo huhulika kulawa kwa Tata, nayo ulamuzi wangu wa kweli. Ivo hulonda nie sio kutenda ivo hubweda nie mwenyewe, mbali hutenda ivo akubweda ila anitumile. <verse eid="JHN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />Nikalonga mbuli zangu mwenyewe, ayo hulonda kuyalonga sekeyatogoligwe kuwa ya kweli <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Mbali auko imwenga akulonga mbuli zangu, na nie humanya yala akuyalonga kwaajili yangu ni ya kweli. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Mweye mtuma want'hu kwa Yohana, nae akawalongela mbuli za ukweli. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Nie sikulonda want'hu wakunilongela, huyalonga yano ili mdahe kuhonyigwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Yohana kakala kimuli kikwaka na kumulika, na mweya kwa chipindi kidodo muwa tiali kuudenk'helela lumuli wake. <verse eid="JHN 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />Mbali nie nina mbuli nyingi za kuwalagisa ukweli wa kila nikilongile kuhuma yala ayalongile Yohana. Kwa vila sank'hano zila anink'hile Tata nizitende ndo zikuwalagisa kuwa Tata ndo anitumile. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Na Tata anitumile akulonga kwa ajili yangu, ikawa mweye hamuihulike sauti yake egu kumwona ivo eli, <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />na mbuli yake haikukala mgati mmwenu kwa vila hamumtogole ila amtumile. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Mweye mkuyapelemba maandiko ya Mulungu mkugesa nampate ugima wa siku zose, mbali maandiko ayo yakulonga mbuli zangu! <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Mbali mweye hamkulonda kwiza kumwangu ili mpate ugima.<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />“Nie sikuhokela utunyo kulawa kwa want'hu. <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />Mbali nie huwamanya kuwa mweye hamukumbweda Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Nie niza kwa ukulu wa Tati yangu, mweye hamnihokele, mbali mnt'hu imwenga akeza kwa ukulu wake, iyo nammuhokele. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Mweye mkudahaze kutogola ikawa mkwink'hana utunyo mweye kwa mweye, mbali hamkugangamala kupata utunyo ukulawa kwa Mulungu muhala. <verse eid="JHN 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />Msekugesa nie naniwachongee kwa Tata, mbali Musa iyo lolelo dyenu ndo akulonda kuwachongea kwa Tata. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Ingi mumtogole kweli Musa, ingi mnitogole na nie, kwa vila Musa kandika mbuli zangu. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Mbali ikawa hamkutogola ayandikile Musa, namdaheze kuyatogola yano huyalonga?”<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akuwalisa want'hu elufu tano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matayo 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maliko 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Ivo yafosile ayo, Yesu akaita mwambo wa ziwa dya Galilaya egu kwa zina dimwenga dikutangigwa ziwa Tibelia. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Pelela kulu dya want'hu dikamkola, kwa vila want'hu ao waona uzonza autendile ya kuwahonya watamu. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Kamala Yesu akakwela mdigamba, akakala hasi hamwenga na Wanahina wake. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Chipindi icho Sikunk'hulu ya Wayahudi ikutangigwa Pasaka ikala haguhi. <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Yesu ivo alolile na kuona uyama mkulu wa want'hu ukumwizila, akamulongela Filipu, “Nachigulehi migate, ili want'hu wano wadye?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Yesu mwenyewe kamanya cha kutenda, mbali kamuuza ivo Filipu ili amgeze. <verse eid="JHN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Filipu akamulongela, “Hata ingi chiwile na migate ya unt'hifili wa hela hazilondile kufaya kugula ndia ya want'hu wano wose hata kila mnt'hu akapata kibenza kidodo cha mgate.” <verse eid="JHN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Mwanahina wake imwe akutangigwa Andilea, mdodo wake Saimoni Petulo, akamulongela, <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />“Hano hana mbwanga imwe ana migate mitano ya shaili na somba waidi, mbali vino navifae mbwani kwa uyama uno wose?” <verse eid="JHN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Yesu akalonga, “Walongeleni want'hu wakale hasi.” Hant'hu aho hakala na mazani madododo, na want'hu wakakala. Hant'hu aho hakala na wanaalume elufu tano. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Kamala Yesu akaisola ila migate akamwink'ha hewala Mulungu, akawenk'ha wala wakalile hasi hadi wakaenela. Vila vila na wala somba akatenda ivo ivo, na kila mnt'hu akapata gesa vila akulonda. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Want'hu ivo wagutile, Yesu akawalongela wanahina wake, “Duganyeni vibenzu visigale vovote visekwaga.” <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Ivo, wakaduganya na wakamemeza visege kumi na vidi va vibenza va migate kulawa muna imigate mitano ila wadile want'hu. <verse eid="JHN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Want'hu ivo waonile kilagiso icho atendile Yesu, wakalonga, “Ino ndo mulotezi wa Mulungu akwiza mui isi.” <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Yesu ivo amanyile kuwa want'hu walonda kumsola ili wamtende awe mwene wawe kwa nguvu, akahalawa kaidi, akaita kudigamba adumwe.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akugenda mchanya ya mazi.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Matayo 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Maliko 6:45-52</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Ivo ifikile dihungile, Wanahina wake wakatelemka hadi kudi ziwa, <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />wakakwela mdidalu ili wavuke kwita Kapelinaumu, na chipindi icho ziza dikuingila, Yesu kakala ank'hali hanawafikila. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Kukawa na mawimbi makulu mdi ziwa kwa vila kukala na vungwa kulu dikuvuma. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Wanahina ivo wakalile waita utali wa gesa kilomita tano egu sita, wakamwona Yesu akugenda mchanya mmazi, akudisogelela dila dalu, wakaogoha nk'hani. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Mbali Yesu akawalongela, “Ni nie, msekuogoha!” <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Ivo wakatogolelena kumkweza Yesu mdidalu, na aho aho wakafika mp'hwani wakalile wakwita.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Want'hu wakumulonda Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Siku da kaidi, uyama wa want'hu wakalile wasigale ubanzi wa kaidi wa ziwa waona kukala na dalu dimwe tu hala, na Yesu haingilile mna ididalu hamwenga na wanahina wake, ila wanahina ao wakala waita wadumwe. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Madalu yamwenga kulawa Tibelia, yakafika hant'hu hala want'hu wadile ila migate, Mndewa ivo amalile kumwink'ha hewala Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Ivo, want'hu ao ivo wamanyile kuwa Yesu na wanahina wake hawahali aho, wakakwela mmadalu yawe, wakaita Kapelinaumu kumulonda Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndo mgate ukugala ugima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Wala want'hu ivo wamfikile Yesu mwambo wa ziwa, wakamuuza, “Mfunza, kufika lini hano?” <verse eid="JHN 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Yesu akawalongela, “Kweli huwalongeleni, mweye mkunilonda sio kwa vila muona vilagiso, mbali kwa vila mudya migate mkeguta.” <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Msekuhunganikila ndia ikuola, mbali hunganikileni ndia ikugala ugima wa siku zose. Icho Mwana wa Mnthu nawenk'heni, kwa vila Mulungu Tata ndo amsagulile na kumtogola. <verse eid="JHN 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Kamala wakamuuza Yesu, “Chikulondigwa chitende mbwani ili chidahe kusank'hana sank'hano za Mulungu?” <verse eid="JHN 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Yesu akawalongela, “Sank'hano ya Mulungu mkulondigwa muitende ni kumtogola ila amtumile.” <verse eid="JHN 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Aho wakamuuza, “Nauchitendele ulagiso uli ili chiuone na kukutogola? Vino, nautende chibwani? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Walala wetu wadya ndia ikutangigwa Mana kula kuchiwala, gesa ivo iyandikigwe mmandiko ya Mulungu, ivo yakulonga, ‘Kawenk'ha ndia ilawile kuulanga kwa Mulungu.’ ” <verse eid="JHN 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Kamala Yesu akawalongela, “Kweli huwalongeleni, sio Musa awenk'hileni migate ilawile kuulanga kwa Mulungu, mbali Tati yangu ndo akuwenk'ha ndia ya kweli kulawa kuulanga kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Kwa vila ndia ya Mulungu ndo ila akutelemka kulawa kuulanga kwa Mulungu na akuwenk'ha ugima want'hu wa mui isi.” <verse eid="JHN 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Ivo, wakamulongela, “Mndewa, chikulomba uwe ukuchink'ha ndia iyo siku zose.” <verse eid="JHN 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Yesu akawalongela, “Nie ndo ndia ya ugima. Mnt'hu akeza kumwangu sekeahulike nzala, mnt'hu akunitogola sekeahulike nk'hilu mbwi. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Mbali gesa ivo niwalongele kuwa, mniona mbali mnk'hali hamkunitogola. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Want'hu wose akulonda kunink'ha Tata nawanikole na mnt'hu yoyote akulonda kwiza kumwangu sekenimuleme, <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Kwa vila nitelemka kulawa kuulanga sio ili nitende ivo hulonda nie, mbali nitende vila akulonda ila anitumile. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Vino nivo akulonda ila anitumile, kuwa nisekumwaza hata imwe hagati mwa wala anink'hile, mbali niwabweleze wose muugima siku ya nk'homelezo. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Kwa vila kint'hu kikulu icho akuchilonda Tati yangu ndo chino. Kila mnt'hu akumwona Mwana na kumtogola awe na ugima wa siku zose bila nk'homelezo, na nie nanimbweleze muugima siku ya nk'homelezo.” <verse eid="JHN 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Wayahudi wakaandusa kumuyungudikila kwa vila kalonga, “Nie ndo ndia itelemkile kulawa kuulanga kwa Mulungu.” <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Wakawa wakulonga, “Vino, ino sio Yesu mwana wa Josefu? Tati yake na mami yake chikuwamanya! Ivo, akudahaze kulonga kuwa katelemka kulawa kuulanga kwa Mulungu?” <verse eid="JHN 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Yesu akawalongela, “Lekeni kuiyungudikila mweye kwa mweye. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Habule Mnt'hu akudaha kwiza kumwangu ikawa havutigwe na Tata anitumile, na nie nanimbweleze muugima mnt'hu iyo siku ya nk'homelezo. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Mvitabu va walotezi iandikigwa, ‘Want'hu wose nawafunzigwe na Tata.’ Kila mnt'hu akumuhulika na kukombaganya kila akulonga Tata, naeze kumwangu. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Ivo, hulonga vino, habule mnt'hu amuonile Tata, mbali ila alawile kwa Mulungu ndo amuonile Tata. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Kweli huwalongela, mnt'hu akutogola anao ugima wa siku zose bila nk'homelezo. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Nie ndo ndia ya ugima. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Walala wenu wadya mana kula kuchiwala na wakadanganika. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Mbali ino ndo ndia ikutelemka kulawa kuulanga kwa Mulungu ili mnt'hu yoyote akaidya asekudanganika. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Nie ndo ndia ngima itelemkile kulawa kuulanga kwa Mulungu. Mnt'hu yoyote akadya ndia ino naakale siku zose bila nk'homelezo. Na ndia hulonda kumwinkha ni mtufi wangu kwaajili ya ugima wa want'hu wa wose mui isi.” <verse eid="JHN 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Niho Wayahudi wakaandusa kulongana hagati yawe, “Mnt'hu ino akudahaze kuchink'ha mtufi wake chiudye?” <verse eid="JHN 6:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Yesu akawalongela, “Kweli huwalongeleni, ikawa hamkuudya mtufi wa Mwana wa Mnt'hu na kung'wa damu yake, sekemuwe na ugima mgati mmwenu. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Ila akulonda kuudya mtufi wangu na kuing'wa damu yangu iyo ana ugima wa siku zose bila nk'homelezo, na nie nanimbweleze muugima siku ya nk'homelezo. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Kwa vila mtufi wangu ni ndia ya kweli na damu yangu ni chint'hu cha kweli chakuking'wa. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Mnt'hu akadya mtufi wangu na kuing'wa damu yangu, akukala mgati mmwangu, na nie hukala mgati mmwake. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Gesa Tata vila eli mgima ivo anitumile, na nie huwa mgima kwa kufosela Tata, Ivo ivo mnt'hu yoyote akunidya nie naapate ugima kufosela kumwangu. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Ino ndo ndia itelemkile kulawa kuulanga kwa Mulungu, sio gesa mana wadile walala wenu, kamala wakadanganika. Mnt'hu akaidya ndia ino naakale na ugima siku zose bila nk'homelezo.” <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Yesu kalonga ayo ivo akalile akufunza mui kaya ya kufikanila Wayahudi uko Kapelinaumu.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli zikugala ugima wa bila nk'homelezo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Ivo, wanahina wengi ivo wahulikile ivo, wakalonga, “Yano ni mafunzo madala. Niani akudaha kuyatogola?” <verse eid="JHN 6:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Nae Yesu akamanya mu moyo wake ya kuwa Wanahina wake wakuyungudika kwa mbuli ino, akawauza, “Vino, hangi mbuli ino ikuwatenda mtuke? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Vino naiweze mkamwona Mwana wa mnt'hu akabwela kuulanga kwa Mulungu kula alawile kumwanduso? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Muhe wa Mulungu ndo ukulava ugima, mtufi muhala haukufaya chint'hu, mbuli izo niwalongeleni ni Muhe na ni ugima. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Mbali wamwenga mgati mmwenu hawakutogola.” Yesu kalonga ivo kwa vila kamanya kulawila kumwanduso niani hakumtogola na niani akulonda kumbiduka. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Kamala akalonga, “Ndo mana huwalongela habule mnt'hu akudaha kwiza kumwangu ikawa hadahizwe na Tati yangu.” <verse eid="JHN 6:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Kulawana na ayo ayalongile Yesu, wanahina wake wamwenga wakamuleka na hawalongozane nayo kaidi. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Ivo elo Yesu akawauza wala wanahina kumi na waidi, “Vino na mweye mkulonda kuhalawa?” <verse eid="JHN 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Simoni Petulo akamulongela, “Mndewa chite kwa niani? Na weye unazo mbuli za ugima ubule nk'homelezo.” <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Cheye chitogola na chimanya ya kuwa weye ndo Mnank'hani wa Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 6:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Yesu akawalongela, “Nie ndo niwasagulile mweye kumi na waidi mbali imwe hagati yenu ni shetani.” <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Yesu kakala kalonga mbuli izo kwa Yuda, Mwana wa Saimoni isikalioti kwa vila iyo ndo ambidukile, ingawa kakala imwe wa wala kumi na waidi.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s">Yesu hakutogolwa na ndugu zake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Na ivo yamalile ayo, Yesu kakala akwita kusank'hana kila hant'hu mdi bululu da Galilaya. Halondile kwita Yudea kwa vila vilongozi wa Wayahudi wakala wakulonda kumkoma. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Na sikunk'hulu ya Wayahudi ya viheha yaani ya kukumbukila kuhamahama mdijangwa ikala ihaguhi. <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Ivo ndugu zake Yesu wakamulongela, “Lawa hano wite Yudea, ili wanahina wako wadahe kuzilola mbui zako izo ukutenda. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Mnt'hu akulonda kumanyika kwa want'hu hakutenda mbuli zake kwa kuifisa, ikawa ukutenda mbuli izo ilagise kwa want'hu wose ili wakumanye.” <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Ndugu zake Yesu walonga ivo kwa vila hata ao hawamtogole. <verse eid="JHN 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Yesu akawalongela, “Mda wangu wa kufaya unk'hali haunafika, mbali kumwenu kila mda ukufaya. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Want'hu wa isi ino hawakudaha kuwehila mweye mbali wakunihila nie kwa vila nie huwalongela kuwa mbuli zawe ziha. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Mweye gendeni kui sikunk'hulu iyo, nie suukwita uko, kwa vila mda wangu unk'hali haunafika.” <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Nae ivo amalile kuwalongela ayo, akasigala uko Galilaya.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mui Sikunk'hulu ya viheha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Mbali ndugu zake ivo wahalawile kwita kui sikunk'hulu, Yesu nae akaita bila ya want'hu kumanya. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Vilongozi wa Wayahudi wakala wakumulonda kui sikunk'hulu iyo, wakauza, “Akwani mnt'hu iyo?” <verse eid="JHN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Kukala na mitagaso mingi mu uyama wa want'hu. Want'hu wamwenga hagati yawe wakalonga, “Ni mnt'hu kadamana.” Wamwenga wakala wakulonga, “Bule! Yeye akuwahunila want'hu.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Mbali habule hata Mnt'hu imwe agezile kulonga mbuli zake halongozi ha want'hu wose kwa vila wakala wakuwaogoha vilongozi wa Wayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Sikunk'hulu iyo ivo ifikile hagati, Yesu nae akaita kui Kaya ya Mulungu na kuandusa kuwafunza want'hu. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Wayahudi wakakangawala na vila akalile akufunza na wakauza, “Mnt'hu ino kadahaze kumanya mbuli zino bila kufunzigwa?” <verse eid="JHN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Niho Yesu akawalongela, “Mafunzo hufunza nie sio yangu, mbali ni yaila anitumile. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Mnt'hu akalonda kutenda yala akuyalonda Mulungu, naamanye kuwa mafunzo yangu yalawa kwa Mulungu egu nie huilongela tu mwenyewe. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Mnt'hu akuilongela mwenyewe akulonda utunyo wake mwenyewe, mbali mnt'hu akulonda utunyo wa ila amtumile, iyo ni mtogofu na mgati mmwake mbule uhuni wowote. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Vino, Musa hawenk'hile Malagilizo? Hata ivo habule hata mnt'hu imwe hagati yenu atozile Lagilizo. Ivo hangi mkulonda kunikoma?” <verse eid="JHN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Aho want'hu wakamulongela, “Weye una chinyamkela! Niani akulonda kukukoma?” <verse eid="JHN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Yesu akawalongela, “Kuna mbuli imwe niitendile, mweye mose mkakangawala. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Musa kawalagilizeni kuwaingiza ulungwana wanenu, mbali Lagilizo idyo hadilawile kwa Musa mbali kwa walala wenu. Na mweye siku zose mkuingiza wanenu ulungwana hata Siku ya Kuhumula. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Ikawa mnt'hu akuingizwa ulungwana mui Siku ya Kuhumula ili Lagilizo dya Musa disekubanangika, hangi mkuona maya kwa vila nimuhonya mnt'hu Siku ya Kuhumula? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Msekumulamula mnt'hu kwa kumulola ivo eli, mbali lamuleni gesa ivo ikulondigwa.”<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vino, ino ndo Kilisito?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Want'hu wamwenga wa Yelusalemu wakala wakuiuza, “Vino, ila mnt'hu wakalile wakumulonda wamkome sio ino? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Elo loleni! Ahano akulonga halongozi ha want'hu wose na habule mnt'hu akumulongela mbuli yoyote. Vino, ikudahikana vilongozi wakumanya kuwa ino ndo Kilisito? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Kilisito akeza habule mnt'hu akulonda kumanya hant'hu alawile, mbali cheye chikumanya uko alawile mnt'hu ino.” <verse eid="JHN 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Yesu ivo akalile akufunza Kui Kaya ya Mulungu akalonga kwa sauti nk'hulu, “Mweye mkunimanya na mkumanya uko hulawa. Nie sizile kwa udahi wangu mwenyewe, mbali yeye anitumile ni wa kweli, na mweye hamummanyile. <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />Mbali nie hummanya kwa vila nilawa kumwake, nae ndo anitumile.” <verse eid="JHN 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Aho ndo want'hu wakalonda kumgwila, mbali habule mnt'hu agezile kumtoza kwa vila saa yake ikala hainafika. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Want'hu wengi hagati ya ula uyama wakamtogola, wakala wakalonga, “Vino, Kilisito muhonyi akeza naatende kilagiso kikulu nk'hani kuhuma atendile mnt'hu ino?”<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wamizi wakutumigwa wamgwile Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Mafalisayo wawahulika want'hu wakutagasa mbuli za Yesu. Ao Mafalisayo na wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko wakawatuma wamizi waite wakamgwile Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Ivo Yesu akalonga, “Nie nink'hali na mweye kwa chipindi chidodo, kamala nanite kwa ila anitumile. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Namnilonde, mbali sekemnione, na hata hala hulonda kuwa nie, mweye hamkudaha kufika.” <verse eid="JHN 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Vilongozi wa Wayahudi wakala wakulongelana, “Mnt'hu ino akulonda kwita kwani uko cheye hachikudaha kumkola? Vino, akulonda kwita kwa Wayahudi waihanganye na Wagiliki na kufunza uko?” <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Yeye akumanisha mbwani kulonga, “Namnilonde mbali sakemnione, na hala hulonda kuwa, mweye hamkudaha kufika?”<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mito ya mazi ya ugima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Siku ya nk'homelezo ya sikunk'hulu iyo ikala siku nk'hulu. Yesu akatimalala akalonga kwa sauti nk'hulu, “Mnt'hu eli na nk'hilu eze kumwangu ang'we.” <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Gesa ivoyakulonga maandiko ya Mulungu, “Yoyote ila akunitogola nie, mito ya mazi ya ugima nayakulume kulawa muumoyo mmwake!” <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Yesu ivo alongile yano kakala akumaanisha Muhe wa Mulungu ila wose wakumtogola yeye nawamuhokele. Kwa vila chipindi icho Muhe kakala hanaeza kwa vila Yesu kakala ank'hali hanatunyigwa.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lumwago mgati ya Want'hu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Want'hu wamwenga hagati ya ula uyama wahulika mbuli izo, wakalonga, “Kweli mnt'hu ino ndo ila mulotezi wa Mulungu!” <verse eid="JHN 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Want'hu wamwenga wakalonga, “Ino ndo Kilisito!” Mbali wamwenga wakalonga, “Ikudahikaze Kilisito kulawa Galilaya? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Vino, maandiko ya Mulungu hayakulonga kuwa Kilisito naeze kulawa muukolo wa Daudi, na naalawe Betilehemu bululu akalile Daudi?” <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Ivo elo, want'hu wakaitump'ha kwaajili ya Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Want'hu wamwenga walonda kumgwila, mbali habule agezile kumgwila.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vilongozi wa Wayahudi wakulema kumtogola Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Kamala wala waamizi wakabwela kwa wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko na Mafalisayo na ao wakawauza, “Hangi hamumgwilile?” <verse eid="JHN 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Waamizi wakawalongela, “Habule mnt'hu akudaaha kulonga gesa ivo akulonga mnt'hu ila!” <verse eid="JHN 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Mafalisayo wakawauza waamizi, “Vino, na mweye muhuniligwa? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Vino, hana kilongozi yoyote egu Mfalisayo amtogolile? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Mbali uyama uno wa want'hu umtogola kuno haukumanya Malagilizo ya Musa, ulongigwa yehile na Mulungu!” <verse eid="JHN 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Imwe hagati ya ao vilongozi kakala Nikodemo, ila akalile kamwitila Yesu ichilo, akawauza, <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />“Vino, Lagilizo dyetu dikumulamula mnt'hu ikawa hanategelezwa na kumanya idyo atendile?” <verse eid="JHN 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Nao wakamulongela, “Vino, weye nae ukulawa Galilaya? Haya genda kayapelembe maandiko ya Mulungu naweye nauone kuwa Galilaya hakulawa mulotezi wa Mulungu.” <verse eid="JHN 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Kamala wakasegela kila mnt'hu akaita ukaya kumwake.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s">Mwanamke agwilige ugoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Kamala Yesu akaita kudi gamba da Mzaituni. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Igolo yake nalugunzu ivo kuchile akaita kaidi kui Kaya ya Mulungu, want'hu wengi wakamwitila na kumzunguluka na yeye akakala na akaandusa kuwafunza. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Wafunza Malagilizo na Mafalisayo wakamgalila Mwanamke agwiligwe ugoni wakamwika halongozi hawe. <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />Kamala wakamulongela Yesu, “Mfunza, mwanamke ino kagwiligwa ugoni. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Muna Amalagilizo yetu chink'hige na Musa kalagiliza want'hu kumkoma kwa kumtowa kwa maibwe wanake gesa ino, mbali weye ukulongaze?” <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Walonga mbuli ino ili wamgeze, ili wapate mbuli ya kumgwila. Mbali Yesu akaidulika hasi kaandusa kuandika kwa kidole chake hasi muulongo. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Nao ivo wagendelele kumuuza, akeinuka akawalongela, “Mnt'hu abule zambi hagati yenu naanduse kumtowa ibwe.” <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Kamala akaidulika kaidi, akawa akuandika hasi. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Nao ivo wahulikile mbuli iyo, wakandusa kuhalawa imwe imwe kuandusila walala. Yesu akasigala adumwe na ila mwanamke katimalala halahala halongozi hake. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Yesu ivo ainukile akamuuza ila mwanamke, “Mama, wakwani wala want'hu wakalile wakukuchongea? Vino, habule mnt'hu yoyote asigalile ili kukulamula?” <verse eid="JHN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Iyo mwanamke akamulongela, “Mkulu, habule hata mnt'hu imwe!” Na Yesu akamulongela, “Hata nie sekehulamule, genda zako na kwandusila haluse usekutenda kaidi zambi.”<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndo lumuli wa want'hu wa mui isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Kamala Yesu ivo ezile kulonga nao kaidi, akawalongela, “Nie ndo lumuli wa want'hu wa mui isi, mnt'hu akanikola nie hakugendela mdiziza mbwi, mbali naawe na lumuli lwa ugima.” <verse eid="JHN 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Mafalisayo wakamulongela, “Weye ukuisimulila mbuli zako mwenyewe, ivo ayo ukuyalonga sio ya kweli.” <verse eid="JHN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Yesu akawalongela, “Nie ingawa husimulila mbuli zangu mwenyewe, mbuli zangu ni za kweli kwa vila nie humanya uko hulawa na uko hwita, mbali mweye hamkumanya uko nilawile wala uko hwita. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Mweye mkulamula gesa want'hu ivo wakulamula, mbali nie sikumulamula mnt'hu yoyote. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Mbali ikawa hulamula, lamulo dyangu ni da kweli kwa vila nie sio nidumwe mbali hulamula hamwenga na Tata anitumile. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Mmalagilizo yenu yandikigwa kuwa yala yakulongwa na want'hu waidi ni ya kutogolwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Nie husimulila mbuli zangu mwenyewe, na Tata anitumile akusimulila mbuli zangu nie.” <verse eid="JHN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Aho wakamuuza, “Akwani Tati yako?” Yesu akawalongela, “Mweye hamnimanyile nie wala Tati yangu. Mbali ingi mnimanyile nie, na Tati yangu ingi mummanyile.” <verse eid="JHN 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Yesu kalonga mbuli izo ivo akalile akafunza mui Kaya ya Mulungu, haguhi na sanduku da kuikila sadaka, na habule mnt'hu amgwilile kwa vila mda wake ukala unk'hali haunafika.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uko hwita nie mweye hamkudaha kufika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Yesu akawalongela kaidi, “Nie huhalawa na mweye namnilonde mbali namdanganike mzi zambi zenu. Uko hwita nie mweye hamkudaha kufika.” <verse eid="JHN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Niho Wayahudi wakaiyuza, “Vino, akulonda kuikoma hangi akulonga uko hwita nie mweye hamkudaha kufika?” <verse eid="JHN 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Yesu akawalongela mweye ni wa hano hano mui isi, mbali nie ni wa kuchanya kuulanga kwa Mulungu, mweye mkulawa hano hasi mui isi mbali nie sio wa isi ino. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Ndo mana niwalongeleni kuwa namdanganike mzi zambi zenu, ikawa hamtogolile kuwa, “Nie Niyo.” Namdanganike mzi zambi zenu. <verse eid="JHN 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Na ao wakamuuza, “Weye niani?” Yesu akawalongela, “Nie ndo ila nikalile huwalongela tangu kumwanduso. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Nina mbuli nyingi za kuwalongela na kuwalamula, mbali anitumile ni wa kweli, na nie huyalonga mui isi yala niyahulike kulawa kumwake.” <verse eid="JHN 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Ao hawamanyile kuwa kakala akulonga nao mbuli za Tata. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Yesu akawalongela, “Mkeza kumwinula Mwana wa Mnt'hu mumti, aho ndo nammanye kuwa, ‘Nie Niyo.’ Na sikutenda kint'hu chochote icho hulonda nie mwenyewe, mbali hutenda yala tu anifuzile Tata. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Ila anitumile ahamwenga na nie, hananileka nidumwe kwa vila siku zose hutenda yala yakumbwedeza.” <verse eid="JHN 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Na ivoakalile akulonga ayo, want'hu wengi wakamtogola.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kweli naiwatende mulekelwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Kamala Yesu akawalongela wala Wayahudi wamtogolile, “Mweye mkakala mui mbuli yangu, namuwe wanahina wangu kweli kweli. <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />Mweye namumanye ukweli, na iyo kweli naiwatende mulekelwe.” <verse eid="JHN 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Nao wakamulongela, “Cheye ni weleko wa Ibulahimu wala hachinawa watwana wa mnt'hu yoyote, ukulongaze nachilekeligwe?” <verse eid="JHN 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Yesu akawalongela, “Tegelezeni, huwalongeleni, kila mnt'hu akutenda zambi ni mtwana wa zambi. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Mtwana hakukala hai kaya siku zose, mbali mwana akukala hai kaya siku zose. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Mwana akatenda mulekelwe, namulekelwe kweli kweli. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Nie humanya mweye ni weleko wa Ibulahimu, mbali mkulonda kunikoma kwa vila mbuli yangu haimuli mgati mmwenu. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Nie hulonga yala niyaonile ivo nikalile na Tata, na mweye vila vila mkutenda yala mulongeligwe na tati yenu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Wakamulongela, “Cheye tati yetu ni Ibulahimu” Yesu akawalongela, “Ingi muwile wana wa Ibulahimu, ingi mtendile gesa ivo atendile Ibulahimu. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Mbali mweye mkulonda kunikoma nie niwalongeleni ukweli niuhulikile kwa Mulungu, mbali Ibulahamu hatendile mbuli gesa iyo. <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Mweye mkutenda mbuli zila akutenda Tati yenu.” Ao wakamulongela, “Usekuchilongela china tata imwenga, chinayo Tati yetu imwe tu, nayo ni Mulungu.” <verse eid="JHN 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Yesu akawalongela, “Mulungu ingi awile Tati yenu, ingi mnibwedile nie, kwa vila nie nilawa kwa Mulungu na haluse nihano. Sizile kwa udahi wangu mwenyewe, mbali wa ila anitumile. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Hangi hamkuyamanya yano huwalongela? Kwa vila hamkudaha kutegeleza icho huwafunza. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Mweye ni wana wa tati yenu Shetani, na mkulonda kutenda yala yakulondigwa na tati yenu. Yeye kakala akukoma tangu haumwanduso na hakukola ukweli, kwa vila ukweli haumuli mgati mmwake. Akahuna, akulonga kulawana na vila eli. Kwavila ni muhuni na ni tata wa uhuni. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Nie hulonga ukweli, mweye hamkunitogola. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Vino niani hagati yenu akudaha kunilongela kuwa nie nina zambi? Ikawa huwalongeleni yala ya kweli, hangi hamkunitogola? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Ila akulawa kwa Mulungu akuzihulika mbuli za Mulungu. Mbali mweye hamkuhulika mbuli za Mulungu kwa vila mweye hamkulawa kwa Mulungu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kakala aho tangu Ibulahimu hanaelekwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Wayahudi, wakamuuza Yesu, “Vino, chihuna ivo chikulonga kuwa weye ni Msamalia na una kinyamkela?” <verse eid="JHN 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Yesu akawalongela, “Nie nibule kinyamkela, mbali nie humtunya Tati yangu, mbali mweye hamkunitunya.” <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Nie sikulonda utunyo wangu mwenyewe, mbali auko akunilondela uo utunyo, na iyo ndo mulamuzi. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Kweli huwalongeleni, mnt'hu akaitegeleza mbuli yangu, naawe mgima siku zose bila nk'homelezo. <verse eid="JHN 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Wayahudi wakamulongela, “Elo chimanya kuwa una kinyamkela! Ibulahimu kadanganika na walotezi wadanganika, mbali weye ukulonga, ‘Mnthu yoyote akaitoza mbuli yangu naawe mgima siku zose bila nk'homelezo!’ <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Vino, weye ukuitenda ni mkulu kuhuma tati yetu Iblahimu na yeye kadanganika? Na walotezi wadanganika, vino weye ukuigesa niani?” <verse eid="JHN 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Yesu akawalongela, “Nikaitunya mwenyewe utunyo wangu si chint'hu, akunitunya nie ni Tati yangu, yeye ndo mkumtanga Mulungu wetu. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Ingawa mweye hamummanyile, mbali nie hummanya. Na nikalonga simmanyile naniwe muhuni gesa mweye. Mbali nie hummanya na mbuli yake huitegeleza. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Ibulahimu Tati yenu, kasant'hila akalolela kuiona siku ya kwiza nie, naye akaiona na akabweda.” <verse eid="JHN 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Ivo Wayahudi wakamuuza, “Weye unk'hali hunafikiza hata myaka hamsini, ukudahaze kulonga kumuona Ibulahimu?” <verse eid="JHN 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Yesu akawalongela, “Huwalongeleni kweli, tangu Ibulahimu hana awa aho ‘Nie Niaho.’ ” <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Aho ndo wakadondola maibwe kulonda kumtoa nayo, mbali Yesu akaifisa, akahalawa hai Kaya ya Mulungu.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akumuhonya mnt'hu aelekigwe chipofu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Siku dimwe Yesu ivo akalile akufosa, akamwona mnt'hu hakuona kulawila kwelekigwa kwake. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Wanahina wake wakamuuza, “Mfunza niani atendile zambi, mnt'hu ino egu welesi wake? Hadi akaelekigwa chipofu?” <verse eid="JHN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Yesu akawalongela, “Ino hatendile zambi wala welesi wake. Mbali kaelekwa chipofu ili udahi wa Mulungu uoneke kufosela ino. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Chikulondigwa chizitende sank'hano zake ila anitumile ikawa chipindi chink'hali msanya, kwa vila chilo chikwiza, na habule mnt'hu akudaha kusank'hana mchipindi icho. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Chipindi chino ninkhali hano hai iisi, nie ni lumuli wa want'hu wa mui isi.” <verse eid="JHN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Ivo akomeleze kulonga ayo, akatema mate hasi akatenda tope na akamuhaka ila chipofu mmeso. <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />Akamulongela, “Genda kanawe mdibwawa dya Siloamu.” Aho ila kipofu akaita akanawa, na akabwela akawa akuona. Mana ya zina dino ni, “Atumigwe.” <verse eid="JHN 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Want'hu wa haguhi yake wala wakalile wakumanya kuwa aho haumwanduso kakala kipofu akulomba, wakauzana, “Vino, ino sio ila kipofu akalile akukala na kulomba?” <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Wamwenga wakalonga, “Ndo yeye” Na wamwenga wakalonga, “Sio yeye, mbali kalingana naye” Mbali yeye mwenyewe akalonga, “Ndo nie.” <verse eid="JHN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Ivo wakala wakumuuza, “Meso yako yadahaze kuona?” <verse eid="JHN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Nae akawalongela, “Mnt'hu ila akutangigwa Yesu katenda tope, akanihaka mmeso akanilongela genda Siloamu ukanawe, nikaita nikanawa, na nikandusa kuona.” <verse eid="JHN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Wakamuuza, “Akwani Mnt'hu iyo?” Nae akawalongela, “Manye uko aitile.”<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafalisayo wakupelemba kuhonyigwa kwa kipofu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Kamala wakamgala iyo mnt'hu akalile kipofu kwa Mafalisayo. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Siku iyo Yesu atendile tope na kuyahonya meso ya ila akalile kipofu, ikala siku ya Kuhumula, <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Niho Mafalisayo wakamuuza mnt'hu iyo, “kudahaze kuona?” Nae akawalongela, “Kanihaka matope mmeso, nikanawa na haluse huona.” <verse eid="JHN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Mafalisayo wamwenga wakalonga, “Mnt'hu ino halawile kwa Mulungu, kwa vila hakutoza Malagilizo ya siku ya Kuhumula.” Na wamwenga wakalonga, “Akudahaze mnt'hu mbananzi kutenda ulagiso gesa uno?” Ivo kukawa na lumwago hagati yao. <verse eid="JHN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Mafalisayo wakabwelela kumuuza ila kipofu, “Weye ndo uhonyigwe meso ukulongaze kuusu mnt'hu iyo?” Nae akawalongela, “Yeye ni mulotezi wa Mulungu.” <verse eid="JHN 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Mbali vilongozi wa Wayahudi hawatogole kuwa mnt'hu iyo kakala kipofu, na vino haluse akuona, hadi ivo wawatangile welesi wake. <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />Wakawauza, “Vino ino ndo mwanenu mulongile eti kaelekigwa kipofu? Haluse akuona, elo kadahaze kuona?” <verse eid="JHN 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Welesi wake wakalonga, “Chikumanya kuwa ino ni Mwanetu, na kakala kaelekigwa kipofu. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Mbali kahonaze cheye hachimanyile, na hachikummanya niani amtendile hadi akuona na niani amuhoneze meso yake. Muuzeni yeye mwenyewe ni mkulu na akumanya kulonga mwenyewe.” <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Welesi wake walonga ayo kwa vila wawaogoha vilongozi wa Wayahudi, kwa vila Wayahudi wakala watogolelana kuwa mnt'hu akatogola kuwa Yesu ni kilisito, nawamulemese kuingila mui kaya ya kufikanila Wayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Ndo mana welesi wake wakalonga, “Iyo mnt'hu ni mkulu mgima, elo muuzeni mwenyewe.” <verse eid="JHN 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Ivo elo wakamtanga lwa kaidi ila akalile kipofu, wakamulongela, mwink'he Mulungu utunyo! Cheye chikumanya ya kuwa mnt'hu ino akuhonyile anazambi. <verse eid="JHN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Ila mnt'hu akalonga, “Nie simanyile ikawa yeye anazambi, mbali mbuli huimanya nie ni imwe tu, nikala kipofu mbali haluse huona.” <verse eid="JHN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Ivo wakamuuza, “kakutendela mbwani hadi ukahona meso yako?” Na katenda mbwani hadi meso yako yakaona? <verse eid="JHN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Akawalongela, “Nie niwalongela kale mbali mweye hamnitegeleze, hangi mkulonda nilonge kaidi? Kwani mkulonda muwe wanahina wake?” <verse eid="JHN 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Haluse elo wakamdukana, wakalonga, “Weye ndo mwanahina wake, cheye wanahina wa Musa. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Cheye chikumanya ya kuwa Mulungu kakala kalonga na Musa, mbali mnt'hu hachimanyile uko alawile.” <verse eid="JHN 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Ila Mnt'hu akawalongela, “Ino ni mbuli ya kukangawaza! Mweye hammanyile uko alawile, mbali yeye kayahonya meso yangu!” <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Ila akalile kipofu akagendelela kulonga, “Chikumanya Mulungu hakuwategeleza want'hu wakutenda zambi, mbali akumtegeleza mnt'hu yoyote akawa akumfugamalila na kutenda yala akuyabweda Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Tangu kulumbwa kwa isi hachina wahi kuona mnt'hu kamtenda mnt'hu aelekigwe kipofu akaona. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Ikawa mnt'hu ino halawile kwa Mulungu, halondile kudaha kutenda mbuli yoyote.” <verse eid="JHN 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Wakamulongela, “Weye kwelekigwa ukawa na zambi, ukulonda kuchifunza cheye?” Ivo wakamuinga alawe mui kaya ya kufikanila Wayahudi.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafalisayo wakupotwa kuumanya ukweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Yesu ivo ahulikile kuwa wamlava mui kaya ya kufikanila Wayahudi, ivo amwonile akamuuza, “Vino, weye ukumtogola Mwana wa Mnt'hu?” <verse eid="JHN 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Iyo mnt'hu akalonga, “Mkulu, yeye niani? Nilongele ili nidahe kumtogola.” <verse eid="JHN 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Yesu akamulongela, “Kumuona kale na ino ukulonga na weye ndo iyo.” <verse eid="JHN 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Nae akalonga, “Hutogola Mndewa.” Kamala kamfugamalila. <verse eid="JHN 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Yesu akalonga, “Niye niza mui isi ili kulamula, ili wala vipofu waone na wala wakuona wawe vipofu.” <verse eid="JHN 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Mafalisayo wamwenga wakalile hamwenga naye wakahulika mbuli izo, wakamuuza, “Vino kweli cheye nao vipofu?” <verse eid="JHN 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Yesu akawalongela, “Ingi muwile vipofu hamulondile kuwa na zambi.” Mbali kwa vila mkulonga, “Mukuona” Mmanye mnk'hali muna zambi.<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s">Mulinganyo wa mdima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />Yesu akawalongela, “Kweli huwalongeleni, mnt'hu yoyote hakwingila mkitole cha ngoto kwa kufosela ha ulwivi, mbali akuibegenyeka na kuingila kwa nzila imwenga iyo ni mbavi na muhoki. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Ila akuingilila kwa kufosela ha ulwivi, ndo mdima wa ngoto. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Mwamizi akumvugulila iyo mdima na ngoto wakumuhulika naye akuwatanga ngoto wake kwa kila imwe kwa zina dyake, na kuwalava mkitole. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Naye akawalava kunze ngoto wake wose, akuwalongolela na wala ngoto wakumkola kunyuma, kwa vila wakuimanya sauti yake. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Ngoto ao hawakudaha kumkola mtafi, mbali nawamkimbile kwa vila hawaimanyile sauti ya mtafi.” <verse eid="JHN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Yesu kawalongela mulinganyo uo, mbali ao hawayakombaganye ayo akalile akuwalongela.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndo mdima adamane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Yesu akalonga kaidi, “Kweli huwalongeleni, nie ni lwivi wa ngoto. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Wose wanilongolele ni wabavi na wahoki mbali ngoto hawawategeleze. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Nie ni lwivi, na mnt'hu yoyote akaingila kufosela kumwangu naahonyeke, naaingile na kulawa kwita hant'hu ha kudya. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Mbavi akwiza ili abawe na kukoma na kubananga, nie niza ili wawe na ugima, kamala wawe na ugima ubule nk'homelezo na wawe nao lundo. <verse eid="JHN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />Nie ni mdima adamane. Mdima adamane akuulava ugima wake kwa ajili ya ngoto. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Mdima wa kulihwa iyo ngoto sio wake, akamuona mbwizi akwiza akuwaleka ngoto na kukimbila, kamala mbwizi akuwagwila na kuwatimula. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Yeye akukimbila kwa vila ni mdima wa kulihwa, wala mbuli ya ngoto kumwake sio chint'hu. <verse eid="JHN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />Nie ni mdima nidamane, nie huwamanya ngoto wangu, na ngoto wangu wakunimanya, <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />gesa Tata ivo akunimanya na nie ivo hummanya Tata. Na nie ni tiali kudanganika kwa ajili ya ngoto. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Nie ninao ngoto wamwenga sio wa mchitole kino, na ao nao vila vila hulondigwa kuwagala aho nili. Na ao nawaihulike sauti yangu, na nahawe na pelela dimwe na mdima imwe. <verse eid="JHN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />Icho akunibwedela Tati yangu kwa vila huulava ugima wangu ili niuhokele kaidi. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Habule mnt'hu wakunihalavila ugima wangu, mbali nie huuhalava mwenyewe. Na nie ninao udahi wa kuulava ugima wangu na ninao udahi wa kuubweleza kaidi, ndagilizi ino niihokela kulawa kwa Tati yangu.” <verse eid="JHN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Wayahudi ivo wahulikile mbuli izo za Yesu wakaigawa. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Wamwenga wao wakalonga, “Ino anakinyamkela na ana chilalu yambwani kumtegeleza?” <verse eid="JHN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Wamwenga wao wakalonga, mbuli zino sio mbuli za mnt'hu eli na kinyamkela. Vino kinyamkela akudaha kuhonya meso ya vipofu?<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akulemigwa na Wayahudi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Uko Yelusalemu kukala na Sikunk'hulu ya ukumbuso wa kuilava kaidi Kaya ya Mulungu kwaajili ya Mndewa, na chipindi icho kikala cha kihuhwe. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Nayo Yesu kakala akugenda kui Kaya ya Mulungu, hadipologwa dya Solomoni. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Pelela dya want'hu wakamzunguluka, Wakamuuza, “Nauchiike mdikeakea hadi lini? Ikawa weye kama ndo Kilisito chilongele bila kuchifisa chimanye.” <verse eid="JHN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Yesu akawalongela, “Nie niwalongeleni kale mbali mweye hamkutogola. Mbuli zino hutenda kwa ukulu wa Tati yangu zikunisimulila nie kumwenu. <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Mbali mweye hamkunitogola, kwa vila mweye sio ngoto wangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Gesa vila ngoto ivo wakuihulika sauti ya mdima wawe, want'hu wangu wakunihulika icho hukilonga. Huwamanya na wakuwa wanahina wangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Nie huwenkha ugima ubule nk'homelezo, na sekewaitump'he na Mulungu mbwi wala habule mnt'hu akudaha kuwalava mmikono yangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Tati yangu anink'hile awo ni mkulu kuhuma wose na habule mnt'hu akudaha kumhoka kulawa mmikono yake. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Nie na Tata ni imwe.” <verse eid="JHN 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Ivo Wayahudi wakadondola Maibwe kaidi kwa kulonda kumtoa. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Yesu akawalongela, “Niwalagisa mbuli nyingi zidamane kulawa kwa Tata. Mbuli ili hagati ya izo ikuwatenda mkulonda kunitoa kwa maibwe?” <verse eid="JHN 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Wayahudi wakamulongela, “Hachuukutoa na maibwe kwa mbuli zidamane utendile mbali kwa kumdukana Mulungu kwa vila weye ni mnt'hu mbali ukuitenda usawa na Mulungu.” <verse eid="JHN 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Yesu akawalongela, “Vino, haiyandikigwe mmaandiko, ‘Nie nilonga kuwa mweye ni gesa Mulungu?’ <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Ikawa wala awenk'hile mbuli yake Mulungu kalonga mkulingana na yeye, ivo Maandiko ya Mulungu ni yakweli siku zose. <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />Vino, mkudahaze kumulongela akudukana ila Tata amulavile kwa sank'hano yake na kumtuma mui isi, kwa vila, nilonga, nie ni Mwana wa Mulungu? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Ikawa sikutenda sank'hano za Tata, msekunitogola. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Mbali nikawa hazitenda sank'hano za Tata japo hamkunitogola nie, zitogoleni zila sank'hano mpate kumanya ya kuwa Tata ahagati yangu na nie ni hagati yake.” <verse eid="JHN 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Wakalonda kumgwila kaidi, mbali akawameng'elenyuka. <verse eid="JHN 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Kamala Yesu akaita mwambo wa mto wa Yoludani, hant'hu hala akalile Yohana akabatiza, akakala uko. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Want'hu wengi wakamwitila Yesu, wakalonga Yohana kweli hatendile vilagiso vovote, mbali yose alongile Yohana kuusu mnt'hu ino ni ya kweli. <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Want'hu wengi wakalile uko wakamtogola Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s">Kudanganika kwa Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Hakala na mnt'hu imwe zina dyake Lazalo, nae kakala mtamu. Yeye kakala akukala Besania hamwenga na Malia na Mata lumbu zake. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Ino Malia ndo ilaila amuhakile Mndewa mavuta ya bei nk'hulu yamp'hovya idamane na kuihangusa migulu kwa nyele zake. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Ivo ao mbudya zake Lazalo, wakagala nt'hume kwa Yesu kumulongela, “Mndewa, ila mbuyako ukumbweda ni mtamu nk'hani.” <verse eid="JHN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Mbali Yesu ivo ahulikile ayo, akalonga, “Utamu uo sekeumkome Lazalo, mbali ni kwa ajili ya utunyo wa Mulungu, ili Mwana wa Mulungu atunyigwe kufosela utamu uo.” <verse eid="JHN 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Hamwenga na ayo, Yesu kakala na umbuya mkulu na Mata, Malia na Lazalo sekulu wawe. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Mbali Yesu ivo ahulikile kuwa Lazalo mtamu, akakala uko kaidi kwa siku mbili. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Kamala, ivo zifosile siku izo Yesu akawalongela wanahina wake, “Chibweleni Yudea.” <verse eid="JHN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Wanahina wake wakamuuza, “Mfunza Wayahudi wakala wakulonda kukukoma kwa kukutoa kwa maibwe, na weye ukulonda kubwela uko?” <verse eid="JHN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Yesu akawalongela, “Vino, saa za msanya sio kumi na mbili? Want'hu wakagenda msanya hawakudaha kuikwala kwa vila akuona lumuli wa isi. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Mbali want'hu wakugenda ichilo wakuikwala kwa vila wabule lumuli mgati yawe wa kuwataza kuona.” <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Yesu ivo akomeleze kulonga mbuli izo, akawalongela, “Mbuya wetu Lazalo kagona mbali hwita kumwinula.” <verse eid="JHN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Wanahina wake wakamulongela, “Mndewa ikawa kagona nt'hongo naainuke tu.” <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Hata ivo Yesu kakala akuwalongela kuwa Lazalo kadanganika, mbali wanahina wake wakala wakugesa Yesu kalonga mbuli ya kugona nt'hongo tu. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Kamala Yesu akawalongela bila kufisa, “Lazalo kadanganika. <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />Mbali hudenk'helela kwaajili yenu kwa vila sikalile uko chipindi akudanganika, ili mdahe kutogola. Elo chiteni kumwake.” <verse eid="JHN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Tomasi akutangigwa pacha akawalongela wanahina wayage, “Cheye nayo chiteni chikadanganike hamwenga na Mndewa.”<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndo ubwelo wa ugima na ugima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Yesu ivo afikile uko kafika Lazalo kazikigwa kale, ana siku ya kane tangu azikigwe. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Kibululu cha Besania kikala haguhi na Yelusalemu, utali wake gesa kilometa nt'hatu kulawa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Wayahudi wengi wakala weza kuwahani Mata na Malia kwa vila wadanganikilwa na mdodo wawe. <verse eid="JHN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Mata ivo ahulike kuwa Yesu keza, akalawa akaita kumuhokela, mbali Malia kasigala hakaya. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Mata akamulongela Yesu, “Mndewa ingi ukalile hano mdodo wangu halondile kudanganika. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Mbali haluse humanya kuwa chochote icho ukulonda kumulomba Mulungu naakwink'he.” <verse eid="JHN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Yesu akamulongela, “Sekulu wako naabwele muugima.” <verse eid="JHN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Mata akamulongela, “Humanya ya kuwa naabwele muugima siku ya nk'homelezo ya want'hu kubwelezigwa muugima.” <verse eid="JHN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Yesu akamulongela, “Nie ndo ubwelezo wa muugima na ndo ugima. Mnt'hu akunitogola nie hata akadanganika, naawe na ugima. <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />Na kila mnt'hu mgima na akunitogola, sekeadanganike mbwi. Vino, ukuitogola ino?” <verse eid="JHN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Mata akamulongela, “Ena Mndewa! Nie hutogola kuwa weye ndo Kilisito usaguligwe na Mulungu, Mwana wa Mulungu yeye akwiza mui isi.”<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumulilila Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Mata ivo akomeleze kulonga ayo, akaita kumtanga Malia lumbudyake hant'hu habule want'hu na kumulongela, “Mfunza ahano akukutanga.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Malia ivo ahulikile ivo, akainuka hima akaita kwa Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Yesu kakala hanaingila kukibululu, mbali kakala ank'hali hant'hu hala afikane na Mata. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Wala Wayahudi wakalile hamwenga na Malia haikaya yake wakumuhani ivo waonile kainuka na kulawa kunze hima, wakamkola wakugesa akwita kula kudikabuli kulilila uko. <verse eid="JHN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Malia ivo afikile hant'hu hala akalile Yesu, akatumbala mavindi yake hasi na kulonga, “Mndewa ingi ukalile hano sekulu wangu halondile kudanganika.” <verse eid="JHN 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Yesu ivo amuonile Malia akulila, na wala Wayahudi wezile hamwenga nayo nao wakulila, akaingilwa na usungu na kuihisi vihile. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Kamala akawauza, “Mumzika kwani?” Wakamulongela, “Mndewa inzo uhaone.” <verse eid="JHN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Yesu akalila. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Aho Wayahudi wakalonga, “Loleni ivo ambwedile Lazalo.” <verse eid="JHN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Mbali want'hu wamwenga hagati yawe wakalonga, “Vino ino amuhonezile kipofu, vino, halondile kudaha kumtenda ino asekudanganika?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumbweleza Lazalo muugima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Ivo Yesu akawa akuugula kaidi mumoyo mmwake, akafika kudikabuli. Idyo kabuli dikala mp'hango digubikigwe na ibwe haumwingililo wake. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Yesu akalonga, “Disegezeni ibwe idyo.” Mata Lumbudyake ila adanganike, akamulongela, “Mndewa kaandusa kale kununk'ha, kwa vila tangu ivo azikigwe ana siku ya kane dielo.” <verse eid="JHN 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Yesu akamulongela, “Sikulongele kuwa ukatogola nauone utunyo wa Mulungu?” <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Ivoelo, wakadisegeza dila ibwe kulawa mudikabuli, Yesu akalola kuchanya kuulanga, akalomba, akalonga “Tata hukwink'ha hewala kwa vila kunihulika. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Humanya ya kuwa weye ukunihulika siku zose, mbali nilonga yano kwaajili ya pelela dya want'hu wano, ili wadahe kutogola kuwa weye ndo unitumile.” <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Ivo akomeleze kulonga ayo, Yesu akatanga kwa sauti nk'hulu, “Weye Lazalo! Lawa kunze.” <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Ila akalile kadanganika akalawa kunze, kuno kafungigwa sanda mmigulu na mmikono, na cheni chake chigubikigwa na kitambala. Yesu akawalongela, “Mfunguleni mulekeni agende.”<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vilongozi wa Wayahudi wakulonda kumkoma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matayo 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1">Maliko 14:1</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1">Luka 22:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:2">2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Ivo Wayahudi wengi wakalile weza na Malia, ivo waonile yala atendile Yesu, wakamtogola. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Mbali wamwenga hagati yawe wakaita kwa Mafalisayo na kuwalongela mbuli zose Yesu atendile. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Ivo elo, wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko na Mafalisayo waika chitala na kulonga, “Chitende mbwani? Kwa vila mnt'hu ino akutenda vilagiso vingi nk'hani. <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Chikamuleka agendelele kutenda vilagiso vino, kila mnt'hu naamtogole, na wakulu wa Kilumi naweze kuchihalavila ukulu wetu mui Kaya yetu ya Mulungu na isi yetu.” <verse eid="JHN 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Imwenga hagati yawe akutangigwa Kayafa yeye kakala mulava nt'hambiko mkulu mwaka uo, akalonga “Mweye hammanyile chint'hu chochote. <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Hammanyile kuwa ni muhavu mnt'hu imwe adanganike kwa ajili ya want'hu wengi, kuliko isi yose ipugutiswe?” <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Yeye halongile ayo kwa ivo akulonda yeye, mbali kwa vila kakala mulava nt'hambiko mkulu mwaka uo, kaona mbuli kuwa Yesu naadanganike kwa ajili ya isi ya Wayahudi, <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />na sio kuwa naadanganike kwaajili ya Wayahudi muhala, mbali kwa ajili ya wana wa Mulungu waitump'hile, ili kuwagala hamwenga na kuwatenda wawe wamwe. <verse eid="JHN 11:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Ivo tangu siku idyo waandusa kulonda nzila ya kumkoma Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Ivo elo, Yesu akawa hagendile kwa kuoneka na Wayahudi, mbali akahalawa hant'hu aho akaita haguhi na chiwala, kukibululu ukutangigwa Efulaimu. Akakala uko hamwenga na wanahina wake. <verse eid="JHN 11:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Sikunk'hulu ya pasaka ya Wayahudi ikala haguhi, want'hu wengi wakala wakulawa mzikaya zao na kwita Yelusalemu ili waisunt'he kwaajili ya sikunk'hulu ya pasaka. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Want'hu wakala wakumulonda Yesu, nao ivo waiduganye hamwe Kui Kaya ya Mulungu, wakauzana, “Mkuonaze? Vino, mnt'hu ino sekeeze mui sikunk'hulu ino?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko na Mafalisayo wakalava ndagilizi kuwa mnt'hu yoyote akamanya hant'hu eli Yesu awalongele ili wamgwile.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s">Malia akumuhaka Yesu mavuta ya bei nk'hulu uko Besania</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Matayo 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Maliko 14:3-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Siku sita haguhi na sikunk'hulu ya Pasaka, Yesu akafika Besania uko akalile akukala Lazalo ila Yesu akalile kambweleza muugima. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Uko wakamsasalila ndia ya dihungile, nae Mata kakala akuwasank'hanila. Lazalo kakala imwe hagati ya wala wakalile hamwenga na Yesu haukudya. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Kamala Malia akasola nusu lita ya mavuta ya nalido yadamane ya hela nyingi, akamuhaka Yesu mmigulu na kuihangusa na nyele zake. Kaya yose ikamema mp'hovya idamane ya mavuta. <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Niho Yuda Isikaliote, imwe wa wala wanahina wake kumi na waidi ila ezile kumbiduka Yesu, akalonga, <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />“Hangi mavuta ayo hayauzigwe kwa maliho ya siku mia wa kibaluwa cha uzenzi na hela izo wakenk'higwa wachiwa?” <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Yuda kalonga ivo, sio kwa vila akuwaonela ubazi wachiwa, mbali kwa vila kakala akutoza mfuko wa kuikila hela na mbavi, na ulo kwa ulo kakala akubawa kulawa mumfuko. <verse eid="JHN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Mbali Yesu akalonga, “Msekumgaza Mama ino, kwa vila kayagula mavuta yano ya bei nk'hulu ili kuusasala mtufi wangu kwa ajili ya kuzikigwa kwangu. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Kwa vila wachiwa namuwe nao siku zose, mbali sekemue na nie siku zose.”<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wayahudi wakulonda nzila ya kumkoma Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Wayahudi wengi wahulika kuwa Yesu kakala Besania. Ivo elo wakaita uko sio tu kwaajili ya kumuona Yesu mbali vila vila na kumuona Lazalo ila ambwelezigwe muugima na Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko wakalonda nzila ya kumkoma na Lazalo. <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />Kwa ajili ya Lazalo, Wayahudi wengi wakaitump'ha na vilongozi wawe, wakamtogola Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akwingila Yelusalemu kwa nk'helegele.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matayo 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maliko 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Igolo yake, pelela kulu dya want'hu wezile kui sikunk'hulu, wahulika kuwa Yesu kakala muinzila akwiza Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Ivo elo, wakasola masant'hi ya mtende, wakalawa kwita kumuhokela, wakalonga kwa sauti nk'hulu, “Chimtunye Mndewa, abalikiigwe ila akwiza kwa zina dya Mndewa. Kabalikiigwa Mwene wa Izilaeli.”<verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Yesu akampata Mwanamp'hunda imwe, akakala mchanya yake gesa maandiko ya Mulungu ivo yakulonga, <verse eid="JHN 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />“Msekuogoha mweye want'hu wa Yelusalemu. Lola Mwene wako akwiza, kapapigwa na mwanamp'hunda.” <verse eid="JHN 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Mda uo wanahina wake hawamanyile mbuli izo, mbali Yesu ivo amalile kutunywa, ndo wakakumbukila kuwa ayo yaandikwa kwaajili yake, na want'hu wamtendela ayo. <verse eid="JHN 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Want'hu wengi wakalile hamwenga na Yesu mda ula amtangile Lazalo kulawa mdikabuli na kumbweleza muugima, wagendelela kusimulila mbuli wazionile. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Want'hu wengi waita kumuhokela kwa vila wakala wahulika katenda vilagiso ivo. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Ivo elo Mafalisayo wakalongelana, “Mkuona? Hachikudaha kutenda chochote, loleni want'hu wose wakumkola yeye.”<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akulotela kudanganika na kubwela muugima kwake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Kukala na Wagiliki wamwenga mwa want'hu wakalile wafika Yelusalemu kufumgamalila Mulungu mui Sikunk'hulu iyo. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Wagiliki ao wamwitila Filipu, mkaya wa bululu dya Betisaida ya Galilaya, wakamulongela, “Mkulu chikulomba kumuona Yesu.” <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Filipu akaita kumulongela Andelea, nao wose waidi wakaita kumulongela Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Yesu akawalongela, “Mda wa kutunyigwa Mwana wa Mnt'hu ufika. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Kweli huwalongeleni, mbeyu ya ngano ikawa hainalagala mui isi na kudanganika na kuhota, ikuwa ivoivo, mbali ikadanganika ikulava mbeyu nyingi. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Want'hu wakuubweda ugima wawe, nawauwaze na want'hu wakuuonela maya ugima wa muna isi ino, nawauwike kwa ajili ya ugima ubule nk'homelezo. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Mnt'hu yoyote akanisank'hanila akulondigwa anikole, na aho hulonda kuwa nie na msank'hani wangu naawe aho. Na mnt'hu yoyote akanisank'hanila Tati yangu namtunye.”<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akulomba Mulungu kwaajili ya kudanganika kwake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />Yesu akagendelela kulonga, “Moyo wangu ukugazika nk'hani, vino nilongeze? Nilonge Tata unihonye kulawa muna mahenyeko yano? Bule, kwa vila niza nidanganike kwaajili ya want'hu wamwenga. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Tata uditunye zina dyako.” Aho sauti ikalonga kulawa kuulanga, “Niditunya na naniditunye kaidi.” <verse eid="JHN 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Want'hu wengi wakalile watimalala aho wahulika sauti iyo, na want'hu wamwenga hagati yao wakalonga, “Ni mdudumo wa ladu.” Mbali wamwenga wakalonga “Msank'hani wa kuulanga kwa Mulungu kalonga nae.” <verse eid="JHN 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Mbali Yesu akawalongela, “Sauti iyo hailawile kwa ajili yangu nie, ila kwa ajili yenu. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Haluse ndo chipindi cha want'hu wa isi ino kulamulwa, elo mwene wa isi ino naahokigwe ukulu wake. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Na nie nikeza kutumbikigwa mchanya ya mti kulawila hasi, naniwatende want'hu wose weze kumwangu.” <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Yesu kalonga ayo kwa kulagisa naadanganike vilihi. <verse eid="JHN 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Ula uyama wa want'hu ukamulongela, “Cheye chihulika kulawa muna Malagilizo yetu kuwa Kilisito asgauligwe na Mulungu sekeadanganeke mbwi. Weye ukudahaze kulonga Mwana wa Mnt'hu akulondigwa atumbikigwe mumti? Vino, ino Mwana wa Mnt'hu niani?” <verse eid="JHN 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Kamala Yesu akawalongela, “Lumuli unk'hali hamwenga kwa chipindi chidodo tu. Gendeni mulumuli kwa vila Lumuli mnk'hali nao ili ziza disekuwafika, kwa vila want'hu akugenda mdiziza hawakumanya uko wakwita. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Kwa vila lumuli mnao ivo utogoleni lumuli uo ili muwe wana wa Lumuli. Ivo akomeleze kulonga mbuli izo.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 12:36">Wayahudi wakulema kumtogola Yesu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Yesu akahalawa akaita kuifisa. <verse eid="JHN 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Ingawa Yesu katenda vilagiso vino vose halongozi yao, mbali ao hawamtogole. <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />Ivo, mbuli alongile Mulotezi Isaya yalawila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">“Mndewa niani aitogolile nt'hume yetu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">Na udahi wa Mndewa wa kuhonya ugubuligwa kwa niani?”<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Ivo hawalondile kutogola, kwa vila Isaya kalonga kaidi. <verse eid="JHN 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />“Mulungu kayapofula meso yawe, na kaitenda mioyo yawe iwa midala kukombaganya ili wasekudaha kuona kwa meso yawe na kukombaganya kwa mioyo yawe wasekwiza kunitogola na nie nikawahonya.” <verse eid="JHN 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Isaya kalonga mbuli zino kwa vila kakala kauona ukulu wa Yesu na akalonga mbuli zake. <verse eid="JHN 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Hamwenga na ayo, Vilongozi wengi wa Wayahudi wamtogola Yesu. Mbali kaajili ya Mafalisayo, hawalongile halongozi ha wanthu kuwa wakumtogola, kwa vila waogoha kuingigwa mui kaya ya kufikanila Wayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Ao wakala wakubweda kutunyigwa na Want'hu kuhuma utunyo ukulawa kwa Mulungu.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu keza kuwahonya want'hu wa isi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Kamala Yesu akalonga kwa sauti nk'hulu, “Mnt'hu akanitogola hakunitogola nie muhala, mbali akumtogola na ila anitumile. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Ila akuniona nie, akumona ila anitumile. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Nie niza niwe lumuli wa want'hu mui isi, ili want'hu wose wakunitogola wasekukala mdiziza kwa kuswela kuumanya ukweli wa Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Mnt'hu akuhulika mbuli zangu na hakuzitoza, nie sekenimulamule kwa vila sizile kuwalamula want'hu wa mui isi mbali niza kuwahonya. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Mnt'hu yoyote akunilema nie na hakuzitoza mbuli zangu, auko akulonda kumulamula, na mbuli yangu nilongile ndo naimulamule siku ya nk'homelezo. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Kwa vila mbuli nizilongile sizilongile kwa ukulu wangu, mbali Tata anitumile ndo anilongele nilonge mbwani na nanilongeze. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Na nie humanya kuwa lagilizo dyake ni ugima ubule nk'homelezo. Ivo elo, nie hulonga tu yala Tata anitumile niyalonge.”<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akuwasunt'ha wanahina wake migulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Ivo ifikile haguhi na sikunk'hulu ya Pasaka, Yesu akamanya kuwa mda wake wa kuhalawa mui isi na kwita kwa Tata ukala ufika. Kakala kawabweda nk'hani Want'hu wake wakalile mui Isi, kweli kakala akuwabweda hadi akaulava ugima wake. <verse eid="JHN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Yesu na Wanahina wake ivo wakalile wakudya ndia ya dihungile. Shetani kakala kamtenda kale Yuda Isikaliote mwana wa Simoni, alonde kumbiduka Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Yesu kuno akamanya kuwa Tata kamwink'ha kila chint'hu kiwe haukulu wake, na kuwa kakala kalawa kwa Mulungu na akubwela kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Ivo, akaleka kudya ndia na, akavula mwenda wake wa kunze akauika kunk'handa, akasola kitambala cha kuhangusila na akaifunga kibwebwe. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Kamala akagela mazi mdibakuli, akandusa kuisunt'ha migulu ya wanahina wake na kwandusa kuwahangusa na kitambala aifungile kibwebwe. <verse eid="JHN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Ivo amfikile Simoni Petulo, Simoni akamuuza, “Mndewa, vino nauninawize na nie migulu?” <verse eid="JHN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Yesu akamulongela, “Haukumanya icho hutenda haluse, mbali nachifike chipindi naumanye.” <verse eid="JHN 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Petulo akamulongela, “Weye sekeuninawize nie migulu mbwi.” Yesu akamulongela, “Ikawa sikunawize migulu sekeuwe na lumbavya na nie.” <verse eid="JHN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Simoni Petulo akamulongela, “Mndewa usekuninawiza migulu muhala mbali ninawize na mikono yangu na mutwi wangu vila vila.” <verse eid="JHN 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Yesu akamulongela, “Mnt'hu aogele kale hakulondigwa kuogela kaidi mbali akulondigwa kunawa migulu muhala, kwa vila mtufi wake wose wela. Mweye mwela mbali sio mose.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Yesu kakala akummanya ila naambiduke, ndo mana kalonga mweye mwela mbali si mose. <verse eid="JHN 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Ivo amalile kuwanawiza migulu yao, akavala kaidi umwenda wake, akabwela ha india akalile, akawauza, “Vino, mkumanya ivo niwatendeleni?” <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Mweye mkunitanga nie Mfunza na Mndewa. Ivo kulonga ivo mukulonga kweli, kwa vila nie ndo iyo. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Ivo elo ikawa nie Mndewa na mfunza wenu niwanawizeni mweye migulu, na mweye ikulondeka muinawize migulu mweye kwa mweye. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Nie niwalagisa mlinganyo uo kuwa ikulondeka mweye kutenda gesa vila nie niwatendeleni mweye. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Kweli huwalongela msank'hani si mkulu kufosa mkulu wake, wala ila atumigwe si mukulu kuhuma ila amtumile. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Elo kwa vila mkuzimanya mbuli zino, Mulungu naawatendele yadamane mkazitenda. <verse eid="JHN 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />Sikulonga ivo kumwenu mweye mose. Mbali huwamanya wala niwasagulile ili ila mbuli yandikigwe idahe kulawila yala yalongile kuwa, “Adile ndia yangu, kanibiduka.” <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Huwalongela mbuli izo zikawa hazinalawila ili zikeza kulawila mpate kutogola ya kuwa, “Nie Ndo.” <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Kweli huwalongela, “Yoyote akumhokela ila anitumile akunihokela na nie, nayo akunihokela nie akumhokela ila anitumile.”<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akulonga mbuli ya kubidukwa kwake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Matayo 26:20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Maliko 14:17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luka 22:21-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Ivo akomeleze kulonga ayo, Yesu akagazika mu umoyo, akalonga, “kweli huwalongeleni, imwe wenu naanibiduke.” <verse eid="JHN 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Wanahina wake wakalolana kwavila hawamanyile kuwa kakala akumulonga niani. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Imwe wa wanahina wake akalile akumbwedigwa nk'hani na Yesu, kakala haguhi na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Simoni Petulo akamtendela kilagiso ila mwanahina, akamulongela kwa kilagiso amuuze Yesu, “Akulonga kuusu niani?” <verse eid="JHN 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Ila mwanahina kuno akawa kamsigamila Yesu, akamuuza, “Mndewa chilongele ukumulonga niani?” <verse eid="JHN 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Yesu akalonga, “Ila hulonda kumwink'ha chino kibenza cha mgate nikakitoweza mumsuzi ndo iyo.” Ivo akasola kibenza cha mgate akakitoweza mumsuzi akamwink'ha Yuda Isikalioti mwana wa Simoni. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Na ivo akihokela icho kibenza cha mgate, shetani akamwingila. Yesu akamulongela Yuda, “Icho ukulonda kukitenda kitende hima.” <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Wala wose wakalile wakudya ndia, habule hata imwe amanyile kuwa hangi Yesu kamulongela ivo. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Kwa vila Yuda kakala akuika hela, wamwenga wagesa Yesu kamulongela Yuda agule vint'hu kwaajili ya sikunk'hulu egu kwaajili ya kuwenk'ha wachiwa. <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Ivo ahokele ula mgate, Yuda akalawa kunze hima. Mda uo ukala ichilo.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lagilizo mpya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Yuda ivo alawile kunze, Yesu akalonga, “Elo Mwana wa Mnt'hu katunyigwa, na Mulungu katunyigwa kufosela yeye. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Ikawa utunyo wa Mulungu ugubuligwa mgati ya Mwana, ivo nae Mulungu naaulagise utunyo wa Mwana mgati yake mwenyewe, na naatende ivo aho aho. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Wanangu, nie nink'hali hamwenga na mweye kwa mda mdodo, namnilonde gesa vila niwalongele Wayahudi, na ivo ivo huwalongeleni mweye. Uko hwita mweye hamkudaha kwiza. <verse eid="JHN 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Huwenk'hani Lagilizo mpya, mbwedane mweye kwa mweye gesa nie ivo niwabwedileni, na mweye mbwedane ivo ivo. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Gesa mkabwedana mweye kwa mweye, kwa nzila ino, want'hu wose nawamanye kuwa mweye ni wanahina wangu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akulotela kulemigwa na Petulo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matayo 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maliko 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Saimoni Petulo akamuuza Yesu, “Mndewa ukwitahi?” Yesu akamulongela, “Kwa haluse uko hwita weye hukudaha kunikola, mbali nawize kunikola.” <verse eid="JHN 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Petulo akamuuza kaidi, “Mndewa hangi sikudaha kukukola haluse? Nie ni tayali kudanganika kwaajili yako.” <verse eid="JHN 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Yesu akamulongela, “Vino ni kweli weye utayali kudanganika kwa ajili yangu? Kweli hukulongela zogole seke alile hadi weye aho ukulonda kunilema mala nt'hatu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ni nzila ya kwita kwa Tata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />Yesu akawalongela wanahina wake, “Msekugazika mmioyo yenu. Mtogoleni Mulungu, nitogoleni na nie vila vila. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Ukaya kwa Tati yangu kuna hant'hu hengi hakukala. Ingi iwile sio ivo, ingi niwalongeleni kale. Hwita kuwasasalila hant'hu hakukala. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Na nikaita kuwasasalila hant'hu ha kukala, nanibwele na kuwasoleni mkale hamwe nanie, ili namweye muwe hala nili. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Mweye mumanya nzila ya kwita uko hwita.”<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Tomasi akamuuza Yesu, “Mndewa cheye hachikumanyile uko ukwita, nachimanyeze nzila ya kwitila?” <verse eid="JHN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Yesu akawalongela, “Nie mwenyewe ndo nzila huwalongela want'hu ukweli wa Mulungu na huwenk'ha ugima wa siku zose. Mnt'hu hakwiza kwa Tata bila kufosela kumwangu. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Ikawa mkunimanya nie, namummanye Tata ivila. Kwandusila haluse, mkummanya Tati yangu na mmuona kale.” <verse eid="JHN 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Filipu akamulongela Yesu, “Mndewa chilagise Tata, iyo naichifaye.” <verse eid="JHN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Yesu akamulongela, “Filipu nikala na mweye chipindi chose, Filipu, vino na weye hunanimanya nie? Mnt'hu yoyote anionile nie kamwona Tata. Ukudahaze kulonga, ‘Chilagise Tata?’ ” <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Vino, hukutogola kuwa nie ni mgati mwa Tata, nae Tata amgati mmwangu? Mbuli huwalongeleni sikuyalonga kwa ukulu wangu. Tata akukala mgati mmwangu, akutenda sank'hano zake. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Mkulondigwa mnitogole nikalonga kuwa nie nimgati mwa Tata na Tata amgati mmwangu, ikawa hamkunitogola nie, togoleni kwa sank'hano izo hutenda. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Kweli huwalongeleni, yoyote akunitogola nie, naazitende sank'hano izo hutenda, na naatende sank'hano nk'hulu kuhuma izo, kwa vila nie hwita kwa Tata. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Na dyodyote mkulonda kudilomba kwa gesa ivohulonda, nie nanikitende, ili Tata atunyigwe mgati ya Mwana. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Mkanilomba dyodyote, gesa ivo hulonda, nanitende.<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akulonga naamgale Muhe wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />Mkanibweda, namuyatende malagilizo yangu. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Nie nanimulombe Tata, nae naawenk'heni Mtazi imwenga, ila akulonda kukala na mweye siku zose bila nk'homelezo. <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />Iyo ndo Muhe wa kweli, want'hu wa isi hawakudaha kumuhokela, kwa vila hawakudaha kumuona na kummanya. Mbali mweye mkummanya kwa vila akukala na mweye na amgati mmwenu. <verse eid="JHN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />“Sekeniwalekeni mdumwe gesa want'hu wabule welesi, nanize kaidi kukala na mweye. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Unk'hali mda mdodo want'hu wa isi sekewanione kaidi, mbali mweye namnione, kwa vila naniwe mgima kaidi, na mweye namuwe ugima wa kweli. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Siku iyo ikafika, nammanye ya kuwa nie ni mgati ya Tata na mweye mumgati yangu na nie ni mgati mmwenu. <verse eid="JHN 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />Mnt'hu yoyote akahokela malagilizo yangu na kuyatenda iyo ndo akunibweda. Na ila akunibweda nie naabwedigwe na Tata, na nie nanimbwede na kuilagisa kumwake.” <verse eid="JHN 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Kamala Yuda imwenga sio Yuda Isikaliote, akamuuza, “Mndewa naidahikeze weye kuilagisa kumwetu na sio kwa want'hu wa isi?” <verse eid="JHN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Yesu akamulongela, “Want'hu wala wakunibweda nawatende icho hukilonga, na Tati yangu naawabwede, na cheye nachize kumwawe na kukala hamwenga nao. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Mnthu yoyote hakunibweda hakutenda icho hulonga. Na nt'hume muhulike sio yangu, mbali ni ya Tata anitumile. <verse eid="JHN 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />Niwafunza mbuli zino nikawa nink'hali hamwenga na mweye. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Mbali Mtazi ila Muhe wa Mulungu ila Tata naamtume kumwenu badili yangu naawafunze mbuli zose na kuwakumbuseni yose niwalongele.” <verse eid="JHN 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />Huwalekeleni utindiwazi, ena! Huwenk'heni utindiwazi wangu. Utindiwazi huwenk'hani sio gesa want'hu wa isi ivowakuwenk'ha. Msekugazika mumoyo na wala msekuogoha. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Mnihulika halonga, hwita zangu, mbali nanibwele kaidi kumwenu. Ingi mnibwedile kweli, ingi mbwedile kuhulika hwita kwa Tata, kwa vila yeye ni mkulu kufosa nie. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Niwalongela mbuli zino zikawa hazinalawila, ili yakalawila mdahe kutogola. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Sekenilonge na mweye nk'hani, kwa vila ila mkulu wa isi ino akwiza, mbali abule udahi kumwangu, <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />mbali want'hu wa isi wakulondigwa wamanye kuwa humbweda Tata, na ndo mana hutenda kila chint'hu gesa Tata ivo anilagilize.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">Kamala akakomelezela kulonga, “Haya timalaleni chilawe hano.”<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ndo mzabibu wa kweli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />Kamala Yesu akalonga, “Nie ni mzabibu wa kweli, Tata yangu ndo akulima. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Kila tambi mgati mmwangu hadikweleka matunda Tati yangu akudikant'ha, na kila tambi dikweleka akudisafisha ili dyeleke nk'hani. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Mweye muwa kale mnank'hana mmioyo kwaajili ya ila mbuli niwalongeleni. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Kaleni mgati mmwangu, gesa nie ivo hukala mgati mmwenu. Gesa vila tambi hadikudaha kweleka matunda dikawa didumwe, ivo ivo na mweye ikawa hamkukala mgati mmwangu, hamkudaha kweleka matunda.” <verse eid="JHN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />“Nie ndo Mzabibu, na mweye ni matambi. Mnt'hu akukala mgati mmwangu na nie mgati mmwake, iyo akweleka matunda mengi, kwa vila bila ya nie mweye hamkudaha kutenda chochote. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Mnt'hu yoyote hakulonda kukala mgati mmwangu, akusumbigwa kunze gesa tambi ivo dikusumbigwa kunze na kunyala, want'hu wakuyaduganya matambi yanyalile na kuyasoma mmoto. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Mweye mkakala mgati mmwangu, na mbuli zangu zikakala mgati mmwenu, lombeni dyodyote mkudilonda, na mweye namwink'higwe. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Tati yangu akutunywa ikawa mkutenda mbuli nyingi za kumbwedeza Mulungu, namweye namuwe wanahina wangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Gesa vila Tata ivo anibwedile, na nie ivo ivo niwabweda, kaleni muubwedo wangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Mkayatoza malagilizo yangu, naamkale muubwedo wangu, gesa nie ivo niyatozile malagilizo ya Tati yangu na kukala muubwedo wake.” <verse eid="JHN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />Niwalongela mbuli zino ili ubwedo wangu ukale mgati mmwenu, na ubwedo wenu uwe utoga. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Malagilizo yangu ndo yano, mbwedane gesa nie ivo niwabwedile. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Habule ubwedo mkulu kuhuma ubwedo uno wa mnt'hu kuulava ugima wake kwaajila ya mbuya zake. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Mweye ni wambuya zangu, mkatenda yala huwalagiliza. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Mweye sikuwatanga kaidi wasank'hani, kwa vila msank'hani hakumanya icho akutenda mkulu wake. Mbali nie niwatanga mweye mbuya zangu kwa vila niwalongela mbuli zose zila nizihulikile kwa Tati yangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Mweye hamnisagulile nie, mbali nie ndo niwasagula mweye na kuwaika mkatende akuyalonda Mulungu, yala yakulonda kukala siku zose, ili Tata awenk'heni dyoydote mkudilomba gesa ivo akulonda awenk'he. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Dino ndo lagilizo dyangu huwenk'hani, mbwedane.<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Want'hu wa isi nawawaihile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />“Ikawa want'hu wa isi ino wakawehila, mmanye kuwa waniihila nie tangu hawana waihila mweye. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Ingi muwile want'hu wa isi ino, want'hu wa isi ingi wawabwedileni mweye gesa want'hu wawe. Mbali mweye sio wa isi ino, mbali nie niwasagula kulawa hagati ha want'hu wa isi ino, kulawana na iyo want'hu wa isi nawawaihile.” <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Msekuzimiza ila mbuli niwalongeleni kuwasank'hani sio mkulu kuhuma mkulu wake. Ikawa wanihenyeza nie, na mweye nawawahenyeze ivo ivo, ikawa wayahokela mafunzo yangu, ivo ivo nawahokele na mafunzo yenu. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Nawawatendeleni yano yose kwa vila mweye mkunikola nie, kwa vila hawammanyile ila anitumile. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Ingi sizile na kuwalongela mbuli za Mulungu, ingi hawalondile kuwa na zambi, mbali haluse hawakudaha kuiyalala kuwa wabule zambi. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Iyo akuniihila nie, akumuihila na Tati yangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Ingi sitendile kumwao mbuli zila habule mnt'hu imwenga atendile, hawalondile kuwa na ubananzi, mbali haluse waona mbuli nizitendile na wank'hali wakuniihila nie na Tati yangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Ndo mana yala yandikigwe muna Malagilizo yawe ni kweli, “Waniihila bule.” <verse eid="JHN 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />“Mbali akeza iyo Mtazi hulonda kumtuma kumwenu kulawa kwa Tata, uo Muhe wa kweli, ukulawa kwa Tata, yeye naawasimulile mbuli zangu zose. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Namweye mkulondigwa mzisimulila mbuli zangu, kwa vila mkala hamwenga na nie tangu haumwanduso.”<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />Yesu akagendelela kulonga, “Niwalongeleni ayo yose ili mgangamale msekwiza kumulema Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Want'hu nawawaingeni mzikaya za kufikanila Wayahudi, na kipindi kikwiza cha kila mnt'hu akulonda kuwakoma naamanye kuwa akumsank'hanila Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Nao nawawatende yano, kwa vila hawammanyile Tata na wala hawanimanyile nie. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Mbali niwalongeleni mbuli zino ili mda ukafika mkumbuke kuwa nie niwalongeleni kale.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 16:4">Sank'hano ya Muhe wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">Siwalongele ayo tangia ha ukwandusa, kwa vila nikala na mweye. <verse eid="JHN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Elo nie hwita kumwake ila anitumile, mbali habule hata imwe wenu akuniuza, “Ukwitahi?” <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Mbali kwa vila niwalongela ayo, mioyo yenu imema usungu. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Mbali nie huwalongeleni kweli, muhavu nie nisegele kwa vila ikawa sikusegela iyo Mtazi sekeeze kumwenu, mbali nikasegela nanimtume kumwenu. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Naye akeza naawalagise want'hu isi kuhusu zambi na kutogolwa kulongozi kwa Mulungu na ulamuzi. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Watenda zambi kwa vila hawakunitogola. <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />Muhe wa Mulungu naawalagise kwa mbuli ya kutogoligwa kwangu halongozi ha Mulungu kwa vila hwita kwa Tata, na mweye sekemnione kaidi, <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />kwa vila Shetani mkulu wa Isi ino kalamuligwa kale, iyo mtazi naawalagise want'hu wa isi ino vila ulamuzi wawe ivo wili sio wa kweli. <verse eid="JHN 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />“Nik'hali nnayo mengi ya kuwalongeleni, mbali kwa haluse hamkudaha kuyahokela na kuyakombaganya. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Mbali akeza iyo Muhe wa kweli naawalongoze mna ikweli yose, mbali sekealonge kwa udahi wake, mbali naalonge ayo ayahulikile kulawa kumwangu na kuwalongeleni mbuli zikulonda kulawila kulongozi. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Yeye naanitunye nie kwa vila naawalongeleni, yala akulonda kuyahulika kulawa kumwangu. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Vose ivo eli navo Tata, ni vangu, ndo mana nilonga kuwa iyo Muhe naawalongeleni yala akulonda kuyahulika kulawa kumwangu.”<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usungu na Kudenk'helela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />“Chink'hali chipindi chidogo na mweye sekemnione, na chink'hali chipindi chidogo na mweye namnione.” <verse eid="JHN 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Ivo Wanahina wamwenga wakauzana, “Akumanisha mbwani ivo akulonga ank'hali chipindi chidogo sekechimuone na chink'hali chipindi chidogo nachimuone?” Na vilavila akulonga, “Kwa vila hwita kwa Tata?” <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Akalonga chink'hali chipindi chidogo hachikumanya akulonga mbwani. <verse eid="JHN 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Yesu akamanya kuwa walonda kumuuza, ivo akawalongela, “Vino, mkuuzana yala nilongile nink'hali chipindi chidogo sekemunione, na chink'hali chipindi chidogo namunione? <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Huwalongeleni kweli, mweye namlile na kuomboleza, mbali want'hu wa isi nawabwede, namwingile usungu mbali usungu wenu naubiduke denk'ho. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Mda wa mwanamke kweleka ukafika akuona usungu kwa vila mda wake ufika, mbali akeleka akamala akuuzimiza usungu ula kwa vila akudenk'helela mnt'hu kaelekigwa mui isi. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Mweye mna usungu haluse, mbali naniwaone kaidi, na mweye namdenk'helele, na denk'ho idyo habule mnt'hu akulonda kudaha kuwasegezela kumwenu.” <verse eid="JHN 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />Siku iyo sekemnilombe chochote. Kweli huwalongeleni chochote mkulonda kumulomba Tata gesa ivo hulonda naawenk'heni. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Hadi haluse hamnalomba chochote kwa ukulu wangu. Lombeni na mweye namwink'higwe ili denk'ho dyenu ditimie.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kazihuma nguvu bananzi za is ino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />Niwalongeleni mbuli zino kwa visingilimo. Mda ukwiza sekenilonge na mweye gesa ivo, mbali nanilonge na mweye bila kufisa mbuli za Tata. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Siku iyo namulombe gesa ivo mkunitogola nie, na sekeniwalongele, kuwa nanimlombe Tata kwa ajili yenu, <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />kwa vila Tata mwenyewe akuwabweda mweye, kwa vila mweye mnibweda nie na mtogola kuwa nilawa kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Nie nilawa kwa Tata, nikeza mui isi, na haluse huhalawa mui isi na hubwela kwa Tata. <verse eid="JHN 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Ivoelo Wanahina wakamulongela, “Ahaa, elo ukulonga bila kufisa hukutumia visingilimo. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Elo cheye chikumanya kuwa weye ukumanya kila chint'hu, na hukulondigwa kuuzwa chochote, ivo elo chitogola kuwa kulawa kwa Mulungu.” <verse eid="JHN 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Yesu akawauza, vino, elo mtogola? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Mda ukwiza, na ufika kale, ula mweye mose namuimwage kila mnt'hu naaite ukaya kumwake, na nie namnileke nidumwe. Mbali nie sio nidumwe, kwa vila Tata ahamwenga na nie. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Niwalongeleni mbuli zino ili muwe na utindiwazi kwa kuiyunga na nie. Mui isi nampate mahenyeko, muigangamaze kwa vila nie nizihuma nguvu bananzi za isi ino.<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akuwalombela wanahina wake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Yesu ivo akomeleze kulonga ayo, akalola kuchanya kuulanga kwa Mulungu, akalonga, “Tata, ula mda ufika! Mtunye Mwanako ili nae adahe Kukutunya weye. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Kwa vila kumwink'ha Mwanako ukulu mchanya ya want'hu wose ili awenk'he ugima ubule nk'homelezo wala wose umwink'hile. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Na ugima ubule nk'homelezo ndo uno, kukumanya weye udumwe Mulungu wa kweli, na kummanya Yesu kilisito umtumile. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Nie nikutunya hano hai isi kwa kuikomeleza ila sank'hano unink'hile niitende. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Haluse elo, Tata, nitunye halongozi hako kwa ula mtunyo nikalile nao tangu isi hainaumbigwa.”<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />“Nikutenda umanyike kwa want'hu wala unink'hile mui isi. Wakala want'hu wako, na weye ukanink'ha wawe wangu, nao wakuzitenda mbuli zako, <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />haluse wakumanya kuwa kila icho unink'hile kilawa kumwako. <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />Kwa vila nie niwenk'ha mbuli zose unink'hile, nao wazihokela na kumanya kuwa kweli zilawa kumwako na wakutogola kuwa weye ndo unitumile.” <verse eid="JHN 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />“Huwalombela ao. Nie sikuwalombela want'hu wa isi, mbali huwalombela wala unink'hile kwa vila ao ni wako. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Want'hu wose nili nao ni wako, na awako ni wangu, na ukulu wangu uoneka kufosela ao unink'hile. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Nie sekeniwe kaidi mui isi, mbali ao wank'hali mui isi na nie hwiza kumwako. Tata wa udumwenga! Hukulomba uwakunzagize wawe gesa weye ili wawe chint'hu chimwe gesa cheye ivo chihamwe. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Ivo nikalile nao, nie niwakunzagiza goya kwa nguvu ya ukulu wako unink'hile. Nie niwaamila na habule hata mnt'hu imwe hagati yawe agile, mbali mnt'hu imwe tu asaguligwe age ndo agile, ili Maandiko ya Mulungu yadahe kutimia. <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Mbali haluse hwiza kumwako, nilonga mbuli zino mui isi ili wadahe kuwa na bwedo dyangu ditimie mgati yawe. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Nie niwenk'ha mbuli yako, nao want'hu wa isi ino wawaihila, kwa vila ao sio wa want'hu wa isi ino, gesa nie ivo nili sio wa isi ino. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Sikulomba uwalave mui isi, mbali hulomba uwaamile kulawana na ila Mbananzi. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Ao sio wa isi, gesa nie ivo sio wa isi ino. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Watende wawe wako kwa ila kweli yako. Mbuli yako ni ya kweli. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Gesa ivo unitumile mui isi, na nie vila vila niwatuma ao mui isi. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Niilava mwenyewe kumwako ili ao wapate yadamane na ao watendwe wawe wako kwa kufosela ukweli.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />“Sikuwalombela ao muhala, mbali huwalombela ao wose wakulonda kutogola kulawana na nt'hume yawe. <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Hulomba wose wawe chint'hu chimwe gesa vila weye Tata ivo wili mgati mwangu na nie mgati mmwako. Hulomba wawe mgati yetu ili isi idahe kutogola kuwa weye ndo unitumile. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Nie niwenk'ha utunyo ula unink'hile nie, ili wawe chint'hu chimwe gesa cheye ivo chili hamwe. <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Nie nanikale mgati mmwawe na weye naukale mgati mmwangu, ili wakamilike wawe wamwe ili want'hu wa isi wadahe kumanya kuwa weye ndo unitumile na ukuwabweda ao gesa ivo ukunibweda nie.<verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />“Tata! Hulonda ao unink'hile wawe hamwenga na nie hala nili, ili wauwone ukulu wangu unink'hile, kwa vila kunibweda tangu isi hainaumbigwa. <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Tata ukutenda mbuli zidamane siku zose, want'hu wa isi hawakukumanya, mbali nie hukumanya. Wano nao wakumanya kuwa weye ndo unitumile. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Nie nikutenda umanyike kumwawe na nanigendelele kutenda ivo, ili ubwedo wili nao kumwangu uwe mgati yawe, na nie niwe mgati yawe.”<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akugwiligwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matayo 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maliko 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Yesu ivo akomeleze kulonga, akalawa hamwenga na wanahina wake akaita mwambo ya kolongo da Keduloni, hant'hu aho hakala hahandigwa miti ya mizaituni akaingila yeye na wanahina wake. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Yuda, ila ambiduke Yesu, kakala kahamanya hant'hu aho, kwa vila mala nyingi Yesu kakala akwita uko na wanahina wake. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Ivo, Yuda akasola pelela dya watoani wa kilumi na waamizi kulawa kwa wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko na Mafalisayo, akeza nao hala hahandigwa miti ya mizaituni kuno wakawa na vimuli na mawenge na vinthu vakutoanila. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Yesu, kuno akumanya yose yakulonda kumulawila, akalawila akawauza, “Mkumulonda niani?” <verse eid="JHN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Ao wakamulongela, “Yesu wa Nazaleti!” Yesu akawalongela, “Nie niyo.” Na Yuda ila ambiduke Yesu kakala katimalala hamwenga nao. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Yesu ivo awalongele, “Nie niyo.” Wakabwela kunyuma na wakagwa. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Yesu akawauza kaidi, “Mkumulonda niani?” Wakamulongele “Yesu wa Nazaleti.” <verse eid="JHN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Yesu akawalongela, “Niwalongela kale kuwa nie niyo. Ivo elo, ikawa mkunilonda nie, huwalongeleni walekeni wano want'hu wahalawe.” <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Yesu kalonga ayo ili yadahe kulawila yala ayalongile, “Wala unink'hile simwazile hata imwe.” <verse eid="JHN 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Saimoni ila Yesu amtangile Petulo kakala na panga, akadisomola mui yala yake, akamkant'ha gutwi dya kulume msank'hani wa mulava nt'hambiko mkulu. Msank'hani iyo kakala akutangigwa Maliko. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Yesu akamulongela Petulo, “Panga dyako dibweleze mui yala yake. Vino, nisekufosela mahenyeko yala Tata alondile niyafosele?”<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akugaligwa kwa mlava nt'hambiko Mkulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Kamala wala watoani hamwenga na kilongozi wawe na wamizi wa Kaya ya Mulungu wakamgwila Yesu, wakamfunga kwa ngozi, <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />na wakamgala kwa Anasi, akalile mkoi wake Kayafa. Iyo kayafa kakala mulava nt'hambiko mkulu mwaka uo. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Iyo Kayafa ndo akalile kawasongeza Wayahudi kuwa ikulondigwa mnt'hu imwe adanganike kwa ajili ya want'hu wengi.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo akumulema Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Matayo 26:69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Maliko 14:66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luka 22:55-57</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Simoni Petulo hamwenga na mwanahina imwenga wakamkola Yesu. Iyo mwanahina imwenga kakala akumanyika kwa mlava nt'hambiko mkulu, akaingila hamwenga na Yesu mgati ya pologwa da mulava nt'hambiko mkulu. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Mbali Petulo kakala katimalala kunze haguhi na lwivi. Aho ndo mwanahina imwenga akalile akumanyika nk'hani na mmulava nt'hambiko mkulu akalawa kunze na akalonga na mwanamke akalile akuwamila lwivi na akamtogolela Petulo aingile. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Iyo mwanamke akamuuza Petulo, “Vino, na weye ni imwe wa wanahina wa mnt'hu ino?” Petulo akamlongela, “Nie sio mwanahina wake.” <verse eid="JHN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Wasank'hani na wamizi, wakala wakoleza moto kwa vila kukala na mp'heho, wakawa wakotela moto. Naye Petulo kakala katimalala hamwenga nao akotela moto.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlava nt'hambiko mkulu akumuuza Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Matayo 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Maliko 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luka 22:66-71</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Ivo elo, mlava nt'hambiko mkulu akamuuza Yesu mbuli za wanahina wake na kufunza kwake. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Yesu akamulongela, “Nilonga na kila mnt'hu bila kufisa. Siku zose nikala hufunza mzikaya za kufikanila Wayahudi na kufugamalila na hai Kaya ya Mulungu hant'hu ambaho Wayahudi wose wakala wakuifika aho. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Hangi ukuniuza nie? Wauze wala wanihulikile yala niwalongele ao wakumanya yala niyalongile.” <verse eid="JHN 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Ivo amalile kulonga ayo mwamizi imwe akalile katimalala aho akamtoa Yesu nk'huwa muuso, kamala akalonga, “Vino, nivo ukumulongela mlava nt'hambiko mkulu?” <verse eid="JHN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Yesu akamulongela, ikawa nilonga mbuli ihile, lagisa iyo mbuli ihile nilongile, mbali ikawa nilonga mbuli ya kweli hangi mkunitoa? <verse eid="JHN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Kuno Yesu akawa kafungigwa ngozi niho Anasi akamgala kwa mulava nt'hambiko mkulu Kayafa.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo akumulema kaidi Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Matayo 26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Maliko 14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luka 22:58-62</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Chipindi icho Petulo kakala katimalala aho akotela moto. Ivo elo wakamuuza, “Vino na weye ni imwenga wa Wanahina wake?” Yeye akabela akalonga, “Nie sio.” <verse eid="JHN 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Imwenga wa watwana wa mlava nt'hambiko mkulu, ndugu wa ila akant'higwe gutwi na Petulo akamuuza, “Vino, weye sikuonile kula kuimiti ya mizaituni ukawa hamwenga nayo?” <verse eid="JHN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Petulo akalema kaidi, aho aho zogolo dikalila.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akugaligwa kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:1">Matayo 27:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:2">2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Maliko 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka 23:1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Nalugunzu gunzu vilongozi wa Wayahudi wakamsola Yesu kulawa kwa Kayafa, na wakamgala kui kaya ya mwene wa Kilumi, nao ili wadahe kudya Pasaka, hawaingilile muikaya ya Pilato wasekwiza kuswela kutogoleligwa kumfugamalila Mulungu na kuswela kudya Pasaka. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Ivo Pilato akawalawila kunze, akawauza, “Mkumchongea mnt'hu ino kwa mbuli ili abanange?” <verse eid="JHN 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Wakamlongela, “Ingi hatendile ubananzi hachilondile kumgala kumwako.” <verse eid="JHN 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Pilato akawalongela, “Haya, msoleni mweye mkamlamule kwa kukola Malagilizo yenu.” Wayahudi wakamulongela, “Cheye hachikulondigwa kumkoma mnt'hu yoyote.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Walonga ivo ili ulotezi aulongile Yesu ulawile wa kulagisa ni kudanganika kwa vili naadanganike. <verse eid="JHN 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Ivo elo Pilato akaingila mgati ya zumba dya kimwene, akalagiliza Yesu agaligwe, akamuuza, “Weye ndo mwene wa Wayahudi?” <verse eid="JHN 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Yesu akamulongela, “Vino, ukuuza mbuli iyo kwa kugesa weye egu want'hu wamwenga wakulongela mbuli zangu?” <verse eid="JHN 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Pilato akamulongela, “Nie sio Muyahudi, want'hu wa isi yako na vilongozi wa walava nt'hambiko wakugala kumwangu, kubanangaki?” <verse eid="JHN 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Yesu akalonga, Umwene wangu sio wa Isi ino. Umwene wangu ingi uwile wa Isi ino wasank'hani wangu ingi wanitowanile nisekugwiliga na vilongozi wa wayahudi. Mbali Umwene wangu sio wa isi ino. <verse eid="JHN 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Pilato akamuuza, “Ivoelo, weye ni Mwene?” Yesu akamulongeala, “Weye ndo ukulonga kuwa nie ni ndo Mwene. Kwa mbuli ino nielekigwa, na kwa ajili ya dino niza mui Isi, ili niulonge ukweli. Mnt'hu yoyote wa kweli akuihulika sauti yangu.” <verse eid="JHN 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Pilato akamuuza, “Ukweli ndo mbwani?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 18:38">Yesu akulamulwa kukomigwa</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Matayo 27:15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Maliko 15:6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23:13-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Ivo akomeleze kulonga ivo, Pilato akaita kunze kaidi, akawalongela Wayahudi wala wamgalile Yesu, akawalongela, “Sionile ubananzi wowote autendile mnt'hu ino.” <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Mbali mweye muna Malagilizo kuwa kipindi cha Pasaka nimulekele mfungwa imwe mkumulonda, ivo elo mkumulonda nimulekele ino mwene wa Wayahudi? <verse eid="JHN 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Wao wakainula sauti wakalonga, “Sio mnt'hu ino, mbali mulekele Balaba.” Balaba kakala mbavi.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Kamala Pilato akalagiliza wamsole Yesu na wamsapule. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Nao waamizi wakaluka chigata cha miwa, wakamvika Yesu mmutwi na wakamvika nk'hanzu ya kimwene ya zambalau. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Wakala wakukwela hala eli mui nyumba ya kimwene ulo kwa ulo, wakalonga, “Ndamsa mwene wa Wayahudi.” Kuno wakumtoa mank'huwa muuso. <verse eid="JHN 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Pilato akalawa kaidi kunze akawalongela Wayahudi wakalile wafikana hala, “Loleni humulava kumwenu, ili mdahe kumanya kuwa nie sionile mbuli ihile.” <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Ivo elo, Yesu akalavigwa kunze akawa kavala kila chigata cha miwa na ula mwenda wa zambalau. Pilato akawalongela, “Loleni mnt'hu wenu ino hano.” <verse eid="JHN 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Wala Vilongozi wa Walava nt'hambiko na wamizi wa Kaya ya Mulungu ivo wamwonile, wakalonga kwa sauti nk'hulu, “Muwambeni iyo! Muwambe!” Pilato akawalongela, “Msoleni mweye wenyewe mkamuwambe mumsalaba, nie sionile mbuli abanange ya kumulamula.” <verse eid="JHN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Wayahudi wakamulongela, “Cheye chinayo malagilizo na kulawana na malagilizo ayo, akulondigwa kudanganika kwa vila yeye kaitenda Mwana wa Mulungu.” <verse eid="JHN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Pilato ivo ahulikile ayo, akaogoha nk'hani. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Niho Pilato akamsola Yesu akaingila nae mui nyumba, akamuuza Yesu, “Weye kulawahi?” Mbali Yesu halongile kint'hu. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Pilato akamlongela, “Weye ukulema kulonga na nie? Hukumanya ya kuwa nina udahi wa kukulekela egu kukuwamba mumsalaba?” <verse eid="JHN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Aho Yesu akamulongela, “Weye hulondile kuwa na udahi wowote kumwangu ingi hwink'higwe kulawa kwa Mulungu. Ivoelo ila anigalile kumwako ana zambi nk'hulu nk'hani.” <verse eid="JHN 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Kwandusila aho, Pilato kakala akulonda nzila ya kumulekela Yesu, mbali Wayahudi wakaongeza kuguta wakalonga, “Ukamulekela mnt'hu ino, weye sio mbuya wa Kaisali. Mnt'hu yoyose akuitenda kuwa ni mwene akumbela Kaisali mwene mkulu wa Loma.” <verse eid="JHN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Pilato ivo ahulikile mbuli izo, akamulava Yesu kaidi kunze akakala mchisumbi chake cha ulamuzi, hant'hu hakutangigwa “Sakafu ya ibwe.” Kwa Kibulania hakutangigwa Gabata. <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Iyo ikala siku ya Kuisasala na Pasaka iyo ikala gesa saa sita ya msanya. Pilato akawalongela Wayahudi, “Mwene wenu ino hano.” <verse eid="JHN 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Wao wakaguta wakalonga, “Muhalave! Muhalave ukamuwambe.” Pilato akawauza, “vino nikamuwambe Mwene wenu?” Wala viongozi wa Walava nt'hambiko wakamulongela, “cheye chibule Mwene imwenga bali Kaisali.” <verse eid="JHN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Ivoelo, Pilato akamulava Yesu na akawenkha ili wakamuwambe.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 19:16">Yesu akuwambwa mumsalaba</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 19:16">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matayo 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maliko 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Niho wakamsola Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Yesu akawa kaupapa msalaba wake, akalawa kwita hant'hu hakutangigwa, “Bela da mutwi.” Kwa kieblania hakutangwa Goligota. <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Aho ndo wamuwambile mumsalaba. Want'hu wamwenga waidi, wakawambigwa hamwenga nae, imwenga msalaba wake ukala ubanzi wa kumoso wa Yesu na imwenga msalaba wake ukala ubanzi wa kulume wa Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Pilato akandika mchibao, “Yesu wa Nazaleti Mwene wa Wayahudi.” Akakigongomeka mchanya mumsalaba wa Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Kwa vila hant'hu aho awambigwe Yesu hakala haguhi na Wayahudi wengi wakala wakusoma mandiko ayo, ya Kiebulani, Kiyunani na kilumi. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Viongozi wa Walava nt'hambiko wakalema, wakamulongela Pilato, “Usekuandika Mwene wa Wayahudi.” Mbali andika kuwa, “Mnt'hu ino yeye kalonga ndo mwene wa Wayahudi.” <verse eid="JHN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Pilato akawalongela, “Niyandikile niyaandika.”<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Wamizi ivo wamalile kumuwamba Yesu mumsalaba, wakasola myenda yake wakaigawa malundo mane, kila mwamizi na lundo dyake. Mbali wakatogolelana wasekuidega ila nk'hanzu kwa vila ikala ishonigwa na kitambala kimwe kwandusila kuchanya hadi hasi. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Wakalongelana, “Chisekuidega nk'hanzu ino mbali chisagule na chilamule naiwe ya niani.” Mbuli ino itendeka ili yalawila Maandiko ya Mulungu yalongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">“Wakagawilana myenda yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">na mwenda wangu kwa simbi.” Ayo ndo wayatendile wala wamizi.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Mda uo uo haguhi na msalaba wa Yesu wakala watimalala Mami yake, na mbudya wa Mami yake na Malia mke wa Kilopa na Malia wa kulawa Magidala. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Yesu ivo amuonile Mami yake hant'hu hala hamwenga na ila Mwanahina ambwedile katimalala haguhi, akamlongela Mamiake, “Mama lola mwanako iyo aho.” <verse eid="JHN 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Kamala Yesu akamulongela ila mwanahina, “Lola mami yako iyo aho.” Siku idyo idyo ila mwanahina akamsola Mami yake Yesu akaita nayo ukaya kumwake.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akudanganika</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matayo 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maliko 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Ivo yafosile ayo, Yesu kuno akamanya mbuli zimala, ili Maandiko yatimie, akalonga, “Huona nk'hilu.” <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Aho hakala na bakuli imemile siki. Ivo wakachofeka dodoki mui siki, wakaika mulumango wa mti wa hisopo, wakamuikila mmulomo. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Yesu ivo ailanzile siki iyo, Yesu akalonga sank'hano imala. Akadulika mutwi wake hasi, akadanganika.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akutungigwa mkuki mulubavu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Kwa vila ikala siku ya kuisasala na Pasaka, Wayahudi hawalondile mitufi isigale mumsalaba hadi siku ya Humulo, kwa vila siku iyo ya kuhumula ikala mchipindi cha Pasaka. Wayahudi wakamlomba Pilato alagilize migulu ya wala wawambiwe ibwenigwe, na mitufi yao isegezigwe mna imisalaba. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Ivo elo, waamizi wakaita wakaibwena migulu ya mnt'hu wa mwanduso kuwambwa hamwenga Yesu na ila imwenga vila vila. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Mbali ivo wafikile kwa Yesu, wakamuona kuwa kadanganika kale, ivo hawambwenile migulu yake. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Mbali mwamizi imwenga wa wala waamizi akamtunga Yesu mkuki wa mulubavu, aho aho hakalawa damu na mazi. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Mnt'hu aonile mbuli izo ndo alongile ayo, ili mweye mdahe kutogola. Na kulonga alongile ni kweli na akamanya kuwa akulonga ukweli. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Mbuli zino zilawila ili Maandiko yadahe kutimia yala yalongile, “Habule hata vuha dyake dimwe dikulonda kubwenigwa.” <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Vila vila Andiko dimwenga dilonga, “Nawamulole ila wamtungile mkuki.”<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuzikigwa.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matayo 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maliko 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Mbuli izo ivo zifosile, Josefu wa Alimataya, akalile akumtogola Yesu kwa kuifisa kwa kuwaogoha Wayahudi, akamulomba Pilato ausole mtufi wa Yesu. Pilato akamtogolela, ivo akaita akausola uo mtufi. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Na Nikodemo ila haumwanduso kamwitila Yesu ichilo, akeza kagala mavuta yadamane yahanganywe na ubani ya uzamo wa kilo Salasini. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Want'hu ao waidi wakausola mtufi wa Yesu, wakauzingiliza sanda kamala wakamuhaka yala mavuta, gesa ivo wazoele Wayahudi muukuzika. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Hant'hu aho awambigwe Yesu hakala na busitani, na haguhi na muibusitani iyo hakala na kabuli dikalile mpya na habule mnt'hu azikigwe mdikabuli idyo. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Ivo elo, kwa vila siku iyo ikala ni siku ya kuisasala na siku ya Kuhumula, na kwa vila kabuli dikala haguhi, wakamzika Yesu umo.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akubwela muugima</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Matayo 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Maliko 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Na lukwili haguhi na kucha siku ya mwanduso ya wiki, Malia kulawa Magidala akaita kudikabuli, na ivo aitile akadiona dila ibwe dikalile haulwivi wa kabuli dihalavigwa. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Ivo akaita hima hadi kwa Simoni Petulo na ila mwanahina imwenga ila Yesu ambwedile, akawalongela, “Wauhalava mtufi wa Mndewa kudikabuli, na hachikumanya uko wauwikile.” <verse eid="JHN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Petulo na ila mwanahina imwenga wakaita kudikabuli. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Wose waidi wakasumka, mbali ila mwanahina imwenga kasumka nk'hani kuhuma Petulo, akandusa kufika kudikabuli. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Ivo afikile akainama akasungulila mula mgati mdikabuli, akaona sanda muhala ziikigwa, mbali haingilile mgati. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Simoni Petulo nae akafika, akaita dimwe kwa dimwe hadi mgati mdikabuli, umo akaona sanda muhala ziikigwa, <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />na kila kitambala afungigwe Yesu mmutwi. Kitambala icho hakiikigwe hamwenga na ila sanda, mbali kiiviliga na kuikwa hant'hu hake. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Kamala ila mwanahina imwenga alongole kufika hai kabuli nae akaingila mgati, akaona na akatogola. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Kwa vila hadi kipindi icho wakala wank'hali hawanamanya Maandiko ya Mulungu yalongile kuwa ikala ikulondigwa Yesu abwele muugima. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Kamala ao wanahina wakasegela wakabwela ukaya.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumulawila Malia wa kulawa Magidala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:9">Matayo 28:9</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 28:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Maliko 16:9-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Mbali Malia wa kulawa Magidala kakala katimalala kunze ya kabuli akulila. Ivo akalile akulila akainama na akasungulila mdikabuli, <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />akawaona wasank'hani waidi wa kuulanga kwa Mulungu, wavala myenda mizelu, wadundumala hala Mtufi wa Yesu ukalile ugonezwa, imwe kumutwi na imwenga kumigulu. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Ao wasank'hani wa kuulanga kwa Mulungu wakamuuza Malia, “Mama, hangi ukulila?” Akawalongela, “Wauhalava mtufi wa Mndewa wangu, na sikumanya uko wauwikile!” <verse eid="JHN 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Ivo akomeleze kulonga ayo, akabiduka, akamuona Yesu katimalala, mbali hammanyile kuwa ni Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Yesu akamuuza, “Mama, hangi ukulila?” Ukumulonda niani? Malia kagesa ya kuwa ila akalile akalonga nayo ni ila akusank'hana muibusitani, akamulongela, “Mkulu, ikawa weye ndo kuuhalava mtufi, nilongele uko uuwikile, nikausole.” <verse eid="JHN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Yesu akamulongela, “Malia.” Na Malia akabiduka, akamulongela kwa Kiebulania, “Laboni.” Ikumaanisha, “Mfunza.” <verse eid="JHN 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Yesu akamulongela, “Usekunitoza, kwa vila ninkhali sinaita kuchanya kwa Tata. Mbali genda kwa ndugu zangu ukawalongele, hwita kuchanya kwa Tati yangu nae ni Tati yenu, Mulungu wangu nae ni Mulungu wenu.” <verse eid="JHN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Ivo Malia kulawa Magadala akaita kuwalongela wanahina wa Yesu, akalonga, “Nimuona Mndewa.” Na kuwa Yesu kakala kamulongela ayo.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuwalawila Wanahina wake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matayo 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maliko 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Ikala dihungile ya siku ya mwanduso ya juma. Wanahina wakala wafikana hamwe mgati mnyumba, nyivi ikala ivugalwa kwa vila wakala wakawaogoha vilongozi wa Wayahudi. Yesu akeza, akatimala hagati yawe, akawalongela, “Utindiwalo uwe na mweye.” <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Ivo akomeleze kulonga ayo, akawalagisa mikono yake na ubavu wake. Ivo wanahina wakadenk'helela nk'hani kumuona Mndewa. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Yesu akawalongela kaidi, “Utindiwalo uwe na mweye! Gesa, Tata ivo anitumile nie, na nie huwatuma mweye ivo ivo.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Ivo akomeleze kulonga ayo, akawapulizila muhe na kuwalongela, “Hokeleni Muhe wa Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Mkawahalavila want'hu zambi zawe, want'hu ao nawahalaviligwe, na want'hu hamkuwahalavila zambi zawe, nao sekewahalaviligwe zambi zawe.”<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumulawila Tomasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Mbali Tomasi zina dimwenga akutangigwa Didimasi, yani Pacha, imwe wa wala kumi na waidi, hawile hamwenga nao Yesu ivo awalawile. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Ivo wala wanahina wamwenga wakamulongela, “Chimuona Mndewa.” Tomasi akawalongela, “Ikawa sekenione nk'hovu ya misumali mmikono yake na kutoza nk'hovu ya mulubavu wake, nie sekenitogole mbwi.” <verse eid="JHN 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Ivo zifosile siku nane, wanahina wake wakala kaidi hamwe mula mnyumba, Tomasi nae kakala hamwenga nao, milwivi ikala ivugalwa, mbali Yesu akeza, akatimalala hagati yawe, akalonga, “Utindiwalo uwe kumwenu.” <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Kamala akamulongela Tomasi, “Ika kidole chako hano na uilole mikono yangu, golola mkono wako udose ha lubavu wangu. Usekuwa mnt'hu hukutogola, mbali utogole tu.” <verse eid="JHN 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Tomasi akamulongela, “Mndewa wangu na Mulungu wangu.” <verse eid="JHN 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Yesu akamulongela, “Vino, kutogola kwa kuwa kuniona? Nawatendeligwa yadamane na Mulungu wala hawanionile mbali watogola.”<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itendile chitabu chino chiandikigwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Yesu katenda vilagiso vimwenga vingi halongozi ha wanahina wake, mbali vilagiso ivo haviandikigwe mchitabu chino, <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />mbali yano yaandikwa ili mdahe kutogola kuwa Yesu nio Kilisito, Mwana wa Mulungu, na kwa kumtogola mdahe kuwa na ugima wa siku zose kwa kukala mgati mmwake.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akuwalawila wanahina wake Saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Ivo yafosile ayo, Yesu akawalawila kaidi wanahina wake mnk'handa nk'handa mwa ziwa Tibelia. Kawalawila vino. <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Simoni Petulo na Tomasi yaani Pacha na Nasanaeli wa bululu dya Kana ya mui isi ya Galilaya, na wana waidi wa Zebedayo na wanahina wamwenga waidi wa Yesu, wose wakala hamwe. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Simoni Petulo akawalongela wayage, “Nie hwita kukwega Somba.” Nao wakamulongela, “Cheye nachite hamwe na weye.” Ndo wakaita, wakakwela mdadalu, mbali ichilo icho chose hawapatile chochote. <verse eid="JHN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Ivo ifikile lukwili, Yesu akatimalala mnk'handa nk'handa ya ziwa, mbali wanahina hawammanyile kuwa ni Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Yesu akawauza, “Wabwanga, hamnapata somba?” Ao wakamulongela, “Ena! Hachipatile chint'hu.” <verse eid="JHN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Yesu akawalongela “Telemseni lwavu wenu ubanzi wa kulume wa dalu dyenu na nampate Somba.” Ao wakazitelemsa nyavu zawe ubanzi uo, lola wakapata somba wengi nk'hani hadi wakapotwa kunyuta lwavu. <verse eid="JHN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Ila Mwanahina akalile akubwedigwa nk'hani na Yesu, akamulongela Petulo, “Ino ni Mndewa” Simoni Petulo ivo ahulike ayo, akaizingiliza mwenda wake mchigudi kwa kuwa kakala havalile mwenda, kamala akadubwikila mmazi. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Mbali wala Wanahina wamwenga wakalile mp'hwani utali wake gesa mita mia wakeza hadidalu wakanyuta ula lwavu umemile somba. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Ivo wafikile mp'hwani, wakaona moto wa makala ukolezwa na mchanya yake waikigwa Somba na migate. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Yesu akawalongela, “Galeni hano somba kidogo kulawa mwa wala mvuile.” <verse eid="JHN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Simoni Petulo akakwela mdidalu na kuunyuta ula lwavu hadi mp'hwani. Lwavu uo ukala umema somba wakulu mia na hamsini na nt'hatu. Na ingawa lwavu ukala umema somba wengi mbali haudegekile. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Yesu akawalongela, “Inzoni mdye.” Mbali habule hata imwe wa wanahina adahile kumuuza, “Weye niani? Kwa vila wakala wamanya kuwa ila ni Mndewa.” <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Yesu akaita, akasola ula mgate, akawenk'ha, kamala akasola wala somba akawenk'ha. <verse eid="JHN 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Uno ukala lwa katatu Yesu akuwalawila wanahina wake, tangu abwele muugima.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumulagiliza Petulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Ivo wamalile kudya, Yesu akamuuza Simoni Petulo, “Simoni mwana wa Yohana, ukunibweda kweli kuhuma wano wamwenga?” Yesu akamulongela, “Ena Mndewa, na weye ukumanya ya kuwa nie hukubweda.” Yesu akamulongela, “Lisa wanangoto wangu.” <verse eid="JHN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Yesu akamuuza kaidi, “Simoni mwana wa Yohana ukunibweda?” Petulo akamulongela, “Ena Mndewa, weye ukumanya ya kuwa hukubweda.” Yesu akamulongela, “Amila ngoto wangu.” <verse eid="JHN 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Kamala akamuuza lwa katatu, “Petulo, Simoni mwana wa Yohana, vino, ukunibweda?” Petulo akaingila kiholo kwa vila Yesu kamuuza lwa katatu ,“kunibweda?” Akamulongela “Mndewa weye ukumanya yose ya kuwa nie hukubweda.” Yesu akamulongela, “Lisa ngoto wangu.” <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Kweli hukulongela, “Ivo ukalile mbwanga kuzoela kuvala na kwita hohote uko ukulonda, mbali ukawa mlala naugolole mikono yako na mnt'hu imwenga naakuvike mkwiji na kukugala hant'hu hukulondile kwita.” <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Yesu kalonga ivo kulagisa ni kudanganika kwa vilihi Petulo naadanganike ili kumwink'ha Mulungu utunyo. Kamala Yesu akamulongela Petulo, “Nikole.”<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na ila mwanahina imwenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Petulo akabiduka kunyuma, akamwona ila mwanahina akubwedigwa na Yesu akuwakola. Ino nio ila mwanahina asigamile mchifua cha Yesu, ivo wakalile wakadya nayo ndia ila ya Pasaka na akamuuza, “Mndewa niani akulonda kukulema?” <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Petulo ivo amuonile iyo mwanahina akamuuza Yesu, “Mndewa ni mbuli ili ikulonda kumulawila?” <verse eid="JHN 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Yesu akamulongela, “Ikawa hulonda akale hadi nibwele, weye ikukuhusu mbwani? Weye unikole.” <verse eid="JHN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Ivo, mbuli iyo ikaenela hagati ha wala wanahina wamwenga kuwa ino mwanahina sekeadanganike. Mbali Yesu halongile kuwa mwanahina iyo sekeadanganike, mbali kalonga, “Ikawa hulonda asigale hadi ivo hulonda kubwela weye ikukuhusu mbwani?” <verse eid="JHN 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Ino ndo ila mwanahina ayaonile mbuli izo na kuziandika, nacheye chikumanya ya kuwa ayalongile ni ya kweli.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli za nk'homelezo za Yohana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Kuna mbuli zimwenga nyingi atendile Yesu ambazo haziandikigwe, ingi yaandikigwe yose hata isi hailondile kufaya kuviika vitabu vila ambavo viandikwe.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>